stion.difficulty/moderate} :question/id #uuid "6f395246-75c5-52ab-b275-6f768034cd27" :question/math-academy-id "q-34243" :question/problem "Consider the vectors\n\n$$\n{\\mathbf{a}}_{\\mathbf{1}}=\\begin{bmatrix}1 \\\\ 0 \\\\ 1\\end{bmatrix},\\hspace{1em}{\\mathbf{a}}_{\\mathbf{2}}=\\begin{bmatrix}-1 \\\\ 1 \\\\ 1\\end{bmatrix},\\hspace{1em}{\\mathbf{a}}_{\\mathbf{3}}=\\begin{bmatrix}2 \\\\ 0 \\\\ 5\\end{bmatrix},\\hspace{1em}\\mathbf{b}=\\begin{bmatrix}2 \\\\ 3 \\\\ -1\\end{bmatrix}.\n$$\n\nIf ${x}_{1}{\\mathbf{a}}_{1}+{x}_{2}{\\mathbf{a}}_{2}+{x}_{3}{\\mathbf{a}}_{3}=\\mathbf{b},$ then what is ${x}_{1}+{x}_{2}+{x}_{3}?$" :question/worked-solution "If ${x}_{1}{a}_{1}+{x}_{2}{a}_{2}+{x}_{3}{a}_{3}=b$, then we have  \n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{x}_{1}\\begin{bmatrix}1 \\\\ 0 \\\\ 1\\end{bmatrix}+{x}_{2}\\begin{bmatrix}-1 \\\\ 1 \\\\ 1\\end{bmatrix}+{x}_{3}\\begin{bmatrix}2 \\\\ 0 \\\\ 5\\end{bmatrix} & =\\begin{bmatrix}2 \\\\ 3 \\\\ -1\\end{bmatrix} \\\\ \\begin{bmatrix}{x}_{1} \\\\ 0 \\\\ {x}_{1}\\end{bmatrix}+\\begin{bmatrix}-{x}_{2} \\\\ {x}_{2} \\\\ {x}_{2}\\end{bmatrix}+\\begin{bmatrix}2{x}_{3} \\\\ 0 \\\\ 5{x}_{3}\\end{bmatrix} & =\\begin{bmatrix}2 \\\\ 3 \\\\ -1\\end{bmatrix} \\\\ \\begin{bmatrix}{x}_{1}-{x}_{2}+2{x}_{3} \\\\ {x}_{2} \\\\ {x}_{1}+{x}_{2}+5{x}_{3}\\end{bmatrix} & =\\begin{bmatrix}2 \\\\ 3 \\\\ -1\\end{bmatrix}.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nEquating the corresponding components, we get the following system:\n\n$$\n\\left\\{\\begin{aligned}{x}_{1}-{x}_{2}+2{x}_{3} &=2 \\\\ {x}_{2} &=3 \\\\ {x}_{1}+{x}_{2}+5{x}_{3} &=-1\\end{aligned}\\right.\n$$\n\nWe will solve this system using Gaussian elimination. First, we write the augmented matrix for this system:\n\n$$\nM=\\left[\\begin{array}{ccc|c}1 & -1 & 2 & 2 \\\\ 0 & 1 & 0 & 3 \\\\ 1 & 1 & 5 & -1\\end{array}\\right]\n$$\n\nRow-reducing the augmented matrix, we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}M & =\\left[\\begin{array}{ccc|c}1 & -1 & 2 & 2 \\\\ 0 & 1 & 0 & 3 \\\\ 1 & 1 & 5 & -1\\end{array}\\right] & {R}_{3} & :={R}_{3}-{R}_{1} \\\\  & ∼\\left[\\begin{array}{ccc|c}1 & -1 & 2 & 2 \\\\ 0 & 1 & 0 & 3 \\\\ 0 & 2 & 3 & -3\\end{array}\\right] & {R}_{3} & :={R}_{3}-2{R}_{2} \\\\  & ∼\\left[\\begin{array}{ccc|c}1 & -1 & 2 & 2 \\\\ 0 & 1 & 0 & 3 \\\\ 0 & 0 & 3 & -9\\end{array}\\right] & {R}_{3} & :=\\frac{1}{3}{R}_{3} \\\\  & ∼\\left[\\begin{array}{ccc|c}1 & -1 & 2 & 2 \\\\ 0 & 1 & 0 & 3 \\\\ 0 & 0 & 1 & -3\\end{array}\\right].\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nThe system is now \n\n$$\n\\left\\{\\begin{aligned}{x}_{1}-{x}_{2}+2{x}_{3} &=2 \\\\ {x}_{2} &=3 \\\\ {x}_{3} &=-3.\\end{aligned}\\right.\n$$\n\nFrom the third equation, we get ${x}_{3}=-3$ and from the second equation we get ${x}_{2}=3.$ Substituting these into the first equation, we obtain\n\n$$\n{x}_{1}-3+2(-3)=2\\,⟹\\,{x}_{1}=11.\n$$\n\nSo, the solution of the system is ${x}_{1}=11$, ${x}_{2}=3$, and ${x}_{3}=-3,$ which means \n\n$$\n11{a}_{1}+3{a}_{2}-3{a}_{3}=b.\n$$\n\nConsequently, \n\n$$\n{x}_{1}+{x}_{2}+{x}_{3}=11+3-3=11.\n$$"} {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186120349 :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "295ae2fa-32ce-5257-98e5-da2905531d81" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "-25" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186317694} {:answer/id #uuid "2c0453ac-1c05-54e9-8a24-6d3978752a5f" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "-36" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186317702} {:answer/id #uuid "32214845-d636-54a9-9639-3d6949098428" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "5" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186317722} {:answer/id #uuid "7f41ea8e-b9d2-5a9b-86d7-d046fada3b82" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "-3" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186318000} {:answer/id #uuid "9e84c226-cfae-5746-8d8d-79afcdb473ad" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "No solution" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186318104}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "9e84c226-cfae-5746-8d8d-79afcdb473ad" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "No solution" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186318104} :answer-field/id #uuid "0300422c-154e-538a-8d8e-cf91e3cbdbed" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type {:db/ident :answer-field.type/radio} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186318431}] :question/difficulty {:db/ident :question.difficulty/hard} :question/id #uuid "04e10334-4152-5cfe-aad7-249b23effb61" :question/math-academy-id "q-34566" :question/problem "Consider the vectors\n\n$$\n{\\mathbf{a}}_{\\mathbf{1}}=\\begin{bmatrix}1 \\\\ 2 \\\\ 3\\end{bmatrix},\\hspace{1em}{\\mathbf{a}}_{\\mathbf{2}}=\\begin{bmatrix}2 \\\\ 5 \\\\ 6\\end{bmatrix},\\hspace{1em}{\\mathbf{a}}_{\\mathbf{3}}=\\begin{bmatrix}3 \\\\ 2 \\\\ 9\\end{bmatrix},\\hspace{1em}\\mathbf{b}=\\begin{bmatrix}-2 \\\\ -6 \\\\ 7\\end{bmatrix}.\n$$\n\nIf ${x}_{1}{\\mathbf{a}}_{1}+{x}_{2}{\\mathbf{a}}_{2}+{x}_{3}{\\mathbf{a}}_{3}=\\mathbf{b},$ then what is ${x}_{1}+{x}_{2}+{x}_{3}?$" :question/worked-solution "If ${x}_{1}{\\mathbf{a}}_{\\mathbf{1}}+{x}_{2}{\\mathbf{a}}_{\\mathbf{2}}+{x}_{3}{\\mathbf{a}}_{\\mathbf{3}}=\\mathbf{b}$, then we have\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{x}_{1}\\begin{bmatrix}1 \\\\ 2 \\\\ 3\\end{bmatrix}+{x}_{2}\\begin{bmatrix}2 \\\\ 5 \\\\ 6\\end{bmatrix}+{x}_{3}\\begin{bmatrix}3 \\\\ 2 \\\\ 9\\end{bmatrix} & =\\begin{bmatrix}-2 \\\\ -6 \\\\ 7\\end{bmatrix} \\\\ \\begin{bmatrix}{x}_{1} \\\\ 2{x}_{1} \\\\ 3{x}_{1}\\end{bmatrix}+\\begin{bmatrix}2{x}_{2} \\\\ 5{x}_{2} \\\\ 6{x}_{2}\\end{bmatrix}+\\begin{bmatrix}3{x}_{3} \\\\ 2{x}_{3} \\\\ 9{x}_{3}\\end{bmatrix} & =\\begin{bmatrix}-2 \\\\ -6 \\\\ 7\\end{bmatrix} \\\\ \\begin{bmatrix}{x}_{1}+2{x}_{2}+3{x}_{3} \\\\ 2{x}_{1}+5{x}_{2}+2{x}_{3} \\\\ 3{x}_{1}+6{x}_{2}+9{x}_{3}\\end{bmatrix} & =\\begin{bmatrix}-2 \\\\ -6 \\\\ 7\\end{bmatrix}.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nEquating the corresponding components, we get the following system:\n\n$$\n\\left\\{\\begin{aligned}{x}_{1}+2{x}_{2}+3{x}_{3} &=-2 \\\\ 2{x}_{1}+5{x}_{2}+2{x}_{3} &=-6 \\\\ 3{x}_{1}+6{x}_{2}+9{x}_{3} &=7\\end{aligned}\\right.\n$$\n\nWe will solve this system using Gaussian elimination. First, we write the augmented matrix for this system:\n\n$$\nM=\\left[\\begin{array}{ccc|c}1 & 2 & 3 & -2 \\\\ 2 & 5 & 2 & -6 \\\\ 3 & 6 & 9 & 7\\end{array}\\right].\n$$\n\nRow-reducing the augmented matrix, we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}M & =\\left[\\begin{array}{ccc|c}1 & 2 & 3 & -2 \\\\ 2 & 5 & 2 & -6 \\\\ 3 & 6 & 9 & 7\\end{array}\\right] & {R}_{2} & :={R}_{2}+(-2){R}_{1} \\\\  & ∼\\left[\\begin{array}{ccc|c}1 & 2 & 3 & -2 \\\\ 0 & 1 & -4 & -2 \\\\ 3 & 6 & 9 & 7\\end{array}\\right] & {R}_{3} & :={R}_{3}+(-3){R}_{1} \\\\  & ∼\\left[\\begin{array}{ccc|c}1 & 2 & 3 & -2 \\\\ 0 & 1 & -4 & -2 \\\\ 0 & 0 & 0 & 13\\end{array}\\right].\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nThe system is now \n\n$$\n\\left\\{\\begin{aligned}{x}_{1}+2{x}_{2}+3{x}_{3} &=-2 \\\\ {x}_{2}-4{x}_{3} &=-2 \\\\ 0 &=13.\\end{aligned}\\right.\n$$\n\nHowever, the final equation $0=13$  gives a false statement. So the system has no solution."} {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186240992 :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "24228b89-72c1-53f9-96a3-762f6e876413" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "0" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186238375} {:answer/id #uuid "41f9a912-3fc6-5aa1-be4b-82da70d8f8d1" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "1" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186238629} {:answer/id #uuid "48788366-6d42-5df1-818a-252fcb9e825d" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "-1" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186238685} {:answer/id #uuid "67eb2257-68d5-593f-891b-6945f576e00f" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "-3" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186238957} {:answer/id #uuid "d9f9576f-46f8-5778-888b-cb310e6c107d" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "4" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186239958}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "24228b89-72c1-53f9-96a3-762f6e876413" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "0" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186238375} :answer-field/id #uuid "69b9e7b4-1521-54c5-b7f4-d54ad2ab9039" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type {:db/ident :answer-field.type/radio} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186240526}] :question/difficulty {:db/ident :question.difficulty/moderate} :question/id #uuid "0d52be40-210e-5024-9a79-b6ca4323223c" :question/math-academy-id "q-105168" :question/problem "Consider the vectors\n\n$$\n{\\mathbf{a}}_{\\mathbf{1}}=\\begin{bmatrix}1 \\\\ 3 \\\\ -2\\end{bmatrix},\\hspace{1em}{\\mathbf{a}}_{\\mathbf{2}}=\\begin{bmatrix}-3 \\\\ -8 \\\\ 6\\end{bmatrix},\\hspace{1em}{\\mathbf{a}}_{\\mathbf{3}}=\\begin{bmatrix}2 \\\\ 5 \\\\ -3\\end{bmatrix},\\hspace{1em}\\mathbf{b}=\\begin{bmatrix}2 \\\\ 1 \\\\ 2\\end{bmatrix}.\n$$\n\nIf ${x}_{1}{\\mathbf{a}}_{1}+{x}_{2}{\\mathbf{a}}_{2}+{x}_{3}{\\mathbf{a}}_{3}=\\mathbf{b},$ then what is ${x}_{1}+{x}_{2}+{x}_{3}?$" :question/worked-solution "If ${x}_{1}{\\mathbf{a}}_{\\mathbf{1}}+{x}_{2}{\\mathbf{a}}_{\\mathbf{2}}+{x}_{3}{\\mathbf{a}}_{\\mathbf{3}}=\\mathbf{b}$, then we have  \n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{x}_{1}\\begin{bmatrix}1 \\\\ 3 \\\\ -2\\end{bmatrix}+{x}_{2}\\begin{bmatrix}-3 \\\\ -8 \\\\ 6\\end{bmatrix}+{x}_{3}\\begin{bmatrix}2 \\\\ 5 \\\\ -3\\end{bmatrix} & =\\begin{bmatrix}2 \\\\ 1 \\\\ 2\\end{bmatrix} \\\\ \\begin{bmatrix}{x}_{1} \\\\ 3{x}_{1} \\\\ -2{x}_{1}\\end{bmatrix}+\\begin{bmatrix}-3{x}_{2} \\\\ -8{x}_{2} \\\\ 6{x}_{2}\\end{bmatrix}+\\begin{bmatrix}2{x}_{3} \\\\ 5{x}_{3} \\\\ -3{x}_{3}\\end{bmatrix} & =\\begin{bmatrix}2 \\\\ 1 \\\\ 2\\end{bmatrix} \\\\ \\begin{bmatrix}{x}_{1}-3{x}_{2}+2{x}_{3} \\\\ 3{x}_{1}-8{x}_{2}+5{x}_{3} \\\\ -2{x}_{1}+6{x}_{2}-3{x}_{3}\\end{bmatrix} & =\\begin{bmatrix}2 \\\\ 1 \\\\ 2\\end{bmatrix}.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nEquating the corresponding components, we get the following system:\n\n$$\n\\left\\{\\begin{aligned}{x}_{1}-3{x}_{2}+2{x}_{3} &=2 \\\\ 3{x}_{1}-8{x}_{2}+5{x}_{3} &=1 \\\\ -2{x}_{1}+6{x}_{2}-3{x}_{3} &=2\\end{aligned}\\right.\n$$\n\nWe will solve this system using Gaussian elimination. First, we write the augmented matrix for this system:\n\n$$\nM=\\left[\\begin{array}{ccc|c}1 & -3 & 2 & 2 \\\\ 3 & -8 & 5 & 1 \\\\ -2 & 6 & -3 & 2\\end{array}\\right]\n$$\n\nRow-reducing the augmented matrix, we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}M & =\\left[\\begin{array}{ccc|c}1 & -3 & 2 & 2 \\\\ 3 & -8 & 5 & 1 \\\\ -2 & 6 & -3 & 2\\end{array}\\right] & {R}_{2} & :={R}_{2}+(-3){R}_{1} \\\\  & ∼\\left[\\begin{array}{ccc|c}1 & -3 & 2 & 2 \\\\ 0 & 1 & -1 & -5 \\\\ -2 & 6 & -3 & 2\\end{array}\\right] & {R}_{3} & :={R}_{3}+2{R}_{1} \\\\  & ∼\\left[\\begin{array}{ccc|c}1 & -3 & 2 & 2 \\\\ 0 & 1 & -1 & -5 \\\\ 0 & 0 & 1 & 6\\end{array}\\right].\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nThe system is now \n\n$$\n\\left\\{\\begin{aligned}{x}_{1}-3{x}_{2}+2{x}_{3} &=2 \\\\ {x}_{2}-{x}_{3} &=-5 \\\\ {x}_{3} &=6.\\end{aligned}\\right.\n$$\n\nFrom the third equation, we get ${x}_{3}=6.$ Substituting ${x}_{3}=6$ into the second equation, we obtain\n\n$$\n{x}_{2}-6=-5\\,⟹\\,{x}_{2}=1.\n$$\n\nNow, substituting ${x}_{2}=1$ and ${x}_{3}=6$ into the first equation, we obtain\n\n$$\n{x}_{1}-3(1)+2(6)=2\\,⟹\\,{x}_{1}=-7.\n$$\n\nSo, the solution of the system is ${x}_{1}=-7$, ${x}_{2}=1$, and ${x}_{3}=6,$ which means \n\n$$\n-7{\\mathbf{a}}_{\\mathbf{1}}+{\\mathbf{a}}_{\\mathbf{2}}+6{\\mathbf{a}}_{\\mathbf{3}}=\\mathbf{b}.\n$$\n\nConsequently, \n\n$$\n{x}_{1}+{x}_{2}+{x}_{3}=-7+1+6=0.\n$$"} {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186240993 :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "023fcb6e-19a9-5e78-8982-04f818ca611a" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "No solution" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186238099} {:answer/id #uuid "04fb8f1e-74de-53e7-811e-89afaef85a39" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "8" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186238122} {:answer/id #uuid "60fcd9a2-4983-563f-a7a0-4d01c2393643" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "13" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186238907} {:answer/id #uuid "b211c6b0-fbe0-52d2-9297-1454f53b6452" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "21" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186239610} {:answer/id #uuid "f512eece-de08-5c13-ae53-369aa60ff55b" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "11" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186240219}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "023fcb6e-19a9-5e78-8982-04f818ca611a" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "No solution" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186238099} :answer-field/id #uuid "257c3c3e-fb71-526d-8119-cd61bd75c90e" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type {:db/ident :answer-field.type/radio} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186240396}] :question/difficulty {:db/ident :question.difficulty/hard} :question/id #uuid "2b7aaa73-fdec-536a-866a-953c6856f39f" :question/math-academy-id "q-105169" :question/problem "Consider the vectors\n\n$$\n{\\mathbf{a}}_{\\mathbf{1}}=\\begin{bmatrix}1 \\\\ 5 \\\\ -2\\end{bmatrix},\\hspace{1em}{\\mathbf{a}}_{\\mathbf{2}}=\\begin{bmatrix}1 \\\\ 6 \\\\ -2\\end{bmatrix},\\hspace{1em}{\\mathbf{a}}_{\\mathbf{3}}=\\begin{bmatrix}-1 \\\\ -8 \\\\ 2\\end{bmatrix},\\hspace{1em}\\mathbf{b}=\\begin{bmatrix}2 \\\\ -3 \\\\ 4\\end{bmatrix}.\n$$\n\nIf ${x}_{1}{\\mathbf{a}}_{1}+{x}_{2}{\\mathbf{a}}_{2}+{x}_{3}{\\mathbf{a}}_{3}=\\mathbf{b},$ then what is ${x}_{1}+{x}_{2}+{x}_{3}?$" :question/worked-solution "If ${x}_{1}{\\mathbf{a}}_{\\mathbf{1}}+{x}_{2}{\\mathbf{a}}_{\\mathbf{2}}+{x}_{3}{\\mathbf{a}}_{\\mathbf{3}}=\\mathbf{b}$, then we have\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{x}_{1}\\begin{bmatrix}1 \\\\ 5 \\\\ -2\\end{bmatrix}+{x}_{2}\\begin{bmatrix}1 \\\\ 6 \\\\ -2\\end{bmatrix}+{x}_{3}\\begin{bmatrix}-1 \\\\ -8 \\\\ 2\\end{bmatrix} & =\\begin{bmatrix}2 \\\\ -3 \\\\ 4\\end{bmatrix} \\\\ \\begin{bmatrix}{x}_{1} \\\\ 5{x}_{1} \\\\ -2{x}_{1}\\end{bmatrix}+\\begin{bmatrix}{x}_{2} \\\\ 6{x}_{2} \\\\ -2{x}_{2}\\end{bmatrix}+\\begin{bmatrix}-{x}_{3} \\\\ -8{x}_{3} \\\\ 2{x}_{3}\\end{bmatrix} & =\\begin{bmatrix}2 \\\\ -3 \\\\ 4\\end{bmatrix} \\\\ \\begin{bmatrix}{x}_{1}+{x}_{2}-{x}_{3} \\\\ 5{x}_{1}+6{x}_{2}-8{x}_{3} \\\\ -2{x}_{1}-2{x}_{2}+2{x}_{3}\\end{bmatrix} & =\\begin{bmatrix}2 \\\\ -3 \\\\ 4\\end{bmatrix}.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nEquating the corresponding components, we get the following system:\n\n$$\n\\left\\{\\begin{aligned}{x}_{1}+{x}_{2}-{x}_{3} &=2 \\\\ 5{x}_{1}+6{x}_{2}-8{x}_{3} &=-3 \\\\ -2{x}_{1}-2{x}_{2}+2{x}_{3} &=4\\end{aligned}\\right.\n$$\n\nWe will solve this system using Gaussian elimination. First, we write the augmented matrix for this system:\n\n$$\nM=\\left[\\begin{array}{ccc|c}1 & 1 & -1 & 2 \\\\ 5 & 6 & -8 & -3 \\\\ -2 & -2 & 2 & 4\\end{array}\\right].\n$$\n\nRow-reducing the augmented matrix, we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}M & =\\left[\\begin{array}{ccc|c}1 & 1 & -1 & 2 \\\\ 5 & 6 & -8 & -3 \\\\ -2 & -2 & 2 & 4\\end{array}\\right] & {R}_{2} & :={R}_{2}+(-5){R}_{1} \\\\  & ∼\\left[\\begin{array}{ccc|c}1 & 1 & -1 & 2 \\\\ 0 & 1 & -3 & -13 \\\\ -2 & -2 & 2 & 4\\end{array}\\right] & {R}_{3} & :={R}_{3}+2{R}_{1} \\\\  & ∼\\left[\\begin{array}{ccc|c}1 & 1 & -1 & 2 \\\\ 0 & 1 & -3 & -13 \\\\ 0 & 0 & 0 & 8\\end{array}\\right].\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nThe system is now \n\n$$\n\\left\\{\\begin{aligned}{x}_{1}+{x}_{2}-{x}_{3} &=2 \\\\ {x}_{2}-3{x}_{3} &=-13 \\\\ 0 &=8.\\end{aligned}\\right.\n$$\n\nHowever, the final equation $0=8$  gives a false statement. So the system has no solution."} {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186240994 :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "200cb18f-f334-5cc1-92fe-59276f6e627e" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "-3" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186238331} {:answer/id #uuid "355fb48b-9360-5e64-a49e-28f3e7ce5c33" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "6" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186238517} {:answer/id #uuid "43ccb6b1-1509-50bb-81b1-0c4a73a41e16" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "No solution" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186238644} {:answer/id #uuid "5d4f778a-7cda-5396-b040-7a95240b101b" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "-5" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186238869} {:answer/id #uuid "ac46ea11-5d88-5152-b8a7-428c01fce429" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "5" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186239552}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "43ccb6b1-1509-50bb-81b1-0c4a73a41e16" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "No solution" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186238644} :answer-field/id #uuid "8483c7ae-14b3-59f6-a280-e2621e06ed0e" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type {:db/ident :answer-field.type/radio} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186240565}] :question/difficulty {:db/ident :question.difficulty/hard} :question/id #uuid "e2bdebea-6388-5baf-ba9f-1fbe0535b5cc" :question/math-academy-id "q-105170" :question/problem "Consider the vectors\n\n$$\n{\\mathbf{a}}_{\\mathbf{1}}=\\begin{bmatrix}1 \\\\ -1 \\\\ 2\\end{bmatrix},\\hspace{1em}{\\mathbf{a}}_{\\mathbf{2}}=\\begin{bmatrix}4 \\\\ -3 \\\\ 8\\end{bmatrix},\\hspace{1em}{\\mathbf{a}}_{\\mathbf{3}}=\\begin{bmatrix}7 \\\\ -7 \\\\ 14\\end{bmatrix},\\hspace{1em}\\mathbf{b}=\\begin{bmatrix}5 \\\\ -3 \\\\ 7\\end{bmatrix}.\n$$\n\nIf ${x}_{1}{\\mathbf{a}}_{1}+{x}_{2}{\\mathbf{a}}_{2}+{x}_{3}{\\mathbf{a}}_{3}=\\mathbf{b},$ then what is ${x}_{1}+{x}_{2}+{x}_{3}?$" :question/worked-solution "If ${x}_{1}{\\mathbf{a}}_{\\mathbf{1}}+{x}_{2}{\\mathbf{a}}_{\\mathbf{2}}+{x}_{3}{\\mathbf{a}}_{\\mathbf{3}}=\\mathbf{b}$, then we have\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{x}_{1}\\begin{bmatrix}1 \\\\ -1 \\\\ 2\\end{bmatrix}+{x}_{2}\\begin{bmatrix}4 \\\\ -3 \\\\ 8\\end{bmatrix}+{x}_{3}\\begin{bmatrix}7 \\\\ -7 \\\\ 14\\end{bmatrix} & =\\begin{bmatrix}5 \\\\ -3 \\\\ 7\\end{bmatrix} \\\\ \\begin{bmatrix}{x}_{1} \\\\ -{x}_{1} \\\\ 2{x}_{1}\\end{bmatrix}+\\begin{bmatrix}4{x}_{2} \\\\ -3{x}_{2} \\\\ 8{x}_{2}\\end{bmatrix}+\\begin{bmatrix}7{x}_{3} \\\\ -7{x}_{3} \\\\ 14{x}_{3}\\end{bmatrix} & =\\begin{bmatrix}5 \\\\ -3 \\\\ 7\\end{bmatrix} \\\\ \\begin{bmatrix}{x}_{1}+4{x}_{2}+7{x}_{3} \\\\ -{x}_{1}-3{x}_{2}-7{x}_{3} \\\\ 2{x}_{1}+8{x}_{2}+14{x}_{3}\\end{bmatrix} & =\\begin{bmatrix}5 \\\\ -3 \\\\ 7\\end{bmatrix}.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nEquating the corresponding components, we get the following system:\n\n$$\n\\left\\{\\begin{aligned}{x}_{1}+4{x}_{2}+7{x}_{3} &=5 \\\\ -{x}_{1}-3{x}_{2}-7{x}_{3} &=-3 \\\\ 2{x}_{1}+8{x}_{2}+14{x}_{3} &=7\\end{aligned}\\right.\n$$\n\nWe will solve this system using Gaussian elimination. First, we write the augmented matrix for this system:\n\n$$\nM=\\left[\\begin{array}{ccc|c}1 & 4 & 7 & 5 \\\\ -1 & -3 & -7 & -3 \\\\ 2 & 8 & 14 & 7\\end{array}\\right].\n$$\n\nRow-reducing the augmented matrix, we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}M & =\\left[\\begin{array}{ccc|c}1 & 4 & 7 & 5 \\\\ -1 & -3 & -7 & -3 \\\\ 2 & 8 & 14 & 7\\end{array}\\right] & {R}_{2} & :={R}_{2}+{R}_{1} \\\\  & ∼\\left[\\begin{array}{ccc|c}1 & 4 & 7 & 5 \\\\ 0 & 1 & 0 & 2 \\\\ 2 & 8 & 14 & 7\\end{array}\\right] & {R}_{3} & :={R}_{3}+(-2){R}_{1} \\\\  & ∼\\left[\\begin{array}{ccc|c}1 & 4 & 7 & 5 \\\\ 0 & 1 & 0 & 2 \\\\ 0 & 0 & 0 & -3\\end{array}\\right].\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nThe system is now \n\n$$\n\\left\\{\\begin{aligned}{x}_{1}+4{x}_{2}+7{x}_{3} &=5 \\\\ {x}_{2} &=2 \\\\ 0 &=-3.\\end{aligned}\\right.\n$$\n\nHowever, the final equation $0=-3$  gives a false statement. So the system has no solution."} {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186240995 :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "43158102-a49d-59d4-a923-5df48591288f" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "No solution" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186238639} {:answer/id #uuid "7f08fc6f-64b7-5004-936e-7a6c7b50f76f" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "17" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186239160} {:answer/id #uuid "c032bb3d-2af4-5439-b0a3-83a63b9db908" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "19" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186239727} {:answer/id #uuid "c25ef7e8-5b9c-591c-b034-15f9595ed22c" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "3" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186239760} {:answer/id #uuid "c7d1ebe2-d9a0-588f-835e-881ce34c1378" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "7" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186239813}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "43158102-a49d-59d4-a923-5df48591288f" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "No solution" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186238639} :answer-field/id #uuid "83fca8c2-1efe-5ca1-813a-6af2b882ac08" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type {:db/ident :answer-field.type/radio} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186240564}] :question/difficulty {:db/ident :question.difficulty/hard} :question/id #uuid "e25147c5-4650-58c3-bac2-7139801cca6b" :question/math-academy-id "q-105172" :question/problem "Consider the vectors\n\n$$\n{\\mathbf{a}}_{\\mathbf{1}}=\\begin{bmatrix}1 \\\\ -5 \\\\ -3\\end{bmatrix},\\hspace{1em}{\\mathbf{a}}_{\\mathbf{2}}=\\begin{bmatrix}4 \\\\ -21 \\\\ -12\\end{bmatrix},\\hspace{1em}{\\mathbf{a}}_{\\mathbf{3}}=\\begin{bmatrix}-3 \\\\ 14 \\\\ 9\\end{bmatrix},\\hspace{1em}\\mathbf{b}=\\begin{bmatrix}2 \\\\ 8 \\\\ -7\\end{bmatrix}.\n$$\n\nIf ${x}_{1}{\\mathbf{a}}_{1}+{x}_{2}{\\mathbf{a}}_{2}+{x}_{3}{\\mathbf{a}}_{3}=\\mathbf{b},$ then what is ${x}_{1}+{x}_{2}+{x}_{3}?$" :question/worked-solution "If ${x}_{1}{\\mathbf{a}}_{\\mathbf{1}}+{x}_{2}{\\mathbf{a}}_{\\mathbf{2}}+{x}_{3}{\\mathbf{a}}_{\\mathbf{3}}=\\mathbf{b}$, then we have\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{x}_{1}\\begin{bmatrix}1 \\\\ -5 \\\\ -3\\end{bmatrix}+{x}_{2}\\begin{bmatrix}4 \\\\ -21 \\\\ -12\\end{bmatrix}+{x}_{3}\\begin{bmatrix}-3 \\\\ 14 \\\\ 9\\end{bmatrix} & =\\begin{bmatrix}2 \\\\ 8 \\\\ -7\\end{bmatrix} \\\\ \\begin{bmatrix}{x}_{1} \\\\ -5{x}_{1} \\\\ -3{x}_{1}\\end{bmatrix}+\\begin{bmatrix}4{x}_{2} \\\\ -21{x}_{2} \\\\ -12{x}_{2}\\end{bmatrix}+\\begin{bmatrix}-3{x}_{3} \\\\ 14{x}_{3} \\\\ 9{x}_{3}\\end{bmatrix} & =\\begin{bmatrix}2 \\\\ 8 \\\\ -7\\end{bmatrix} \\\\ \\begin{bmatrix}{x}_{1}+4{x}_{2}-3{x}_{3} \\\\ -5{x}_{1}-21{x}_{2}+14{x}_{3} \\\\ -3{x}_{1}-12{x}_{2}+9{x}_{3}\\end{bmatrix} & =\\begin{bmatrix}2 \\\\ 8 \\\\ -7\\end{bmatrix}.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nEquating the corresponding components, we get the following system:\n\n$$\n\\left\\{\\begin{aligned}{x}_{1}+4{x}_{2}-3{x}_{3} &=2 \\\\ -5{x}_{1}-21{x}_{2}+14{x}_{3} &=8 \\\\ -3{x}_{1}-12{x}_{2}+9{x}_{3} &=-7\\end{aligned}\\right.\n$$\n\nWe will solve this system using Gaussian elimination. First, we write the augmented matrix for this system:\n\n$$\nM=\\left[\\begin{array}{ccc|c}1 & 4 & -3 & 2 \\\\ -5 & -21 & 14 & 8 \\\\ -3 & -12 & 9 & -7\\end{array}\\right].\n$$\n\nRow-reducing the augmented matrix, we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}M & =\\left[\\begin{array}{ccc|c}1 & 4 & -3 & 2 \\\\ -5 & -21 & 14 & 8 \\\\ -3 & -12 & 9 & -7\\end{array}\\right] & {R}_{2} & :={R}_{2}+5{R}_{1} \\\\  & ∼\\left[\\begin{array}{ccc|c}1 & 4 & -3 & 2 \\\\ 0 & -1 & -1 & 18 \\\\ -3 & -12 & 9 & -7\\end{array}\\right] & {R}_{3} & :={R}_{3}+3{R}_{1} \\\\  & ∼\\left[\\begin{array}{ccc|c}1 & 4 & -3 & 2 \\\\ 0 & -1 & -1 & 18 \\\\ 0 & 0 & 0 & -1\\end{array}\\right].\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nThe system is now \n\n$$\n\\left\\{\\begin{aligned}{x}_{1}+4{x}_{2}-3{x}_{3} &=2 \\\\ -{x}_{2}-{x}_{3} &=18 \\\\ 0 &=-1.\\end{aligned}\\right.\n$$\n\nHowever, the final equation $0=-1$  gives a false statement. So the system has no solution."} {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186342126 :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "3430db20-ef90-5054-8d8b-b6f798f4c553" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "4" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186339592} {:answer/id #uuid "351054d6-ba57-5e06-82bb-d7c3e717e126" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "3" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186339598} {:answer/id #uuid "bf850701-8c93-5374-9a42-dca7c25ca858" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "5" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186340836} {:answer/id #uuid "cf811142-93c6-5d20-b217-29c2c57c680b" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "6" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186340975} {:answer/id #uuid "dbf87647-1ef7-5b76-85e7-37be4269b0ee" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "No solution" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186341081}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "351054d6-ba57-5e06-82bb-d7c3e717e126" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "3" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186339598} :answer-field/id #uuid "85f23f2c-e934-5f48-ab5a-edc1193c2c22" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type {:db/ident :answer-field.type/radio} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186341615}] :question/difficulty {:db/ident :question.difficulty/moderate} :question/id #uuid "33debd45-f90c-578d-9c6b-11c54937ac6b" :question/math-academy-id "q-73992" :question/problem "Consider the vectors\n\n$$\n{\\mathbf{a}}_{\\mathbf{1}}=\\begin{bmatrix}1 \\\\ 0 \\\\ 3\\end{bmatrix},\\hspace{1em}{\\mathbf{a}}_{\\mathbf{2}}=\\begin{bmatrix}-1 \\\\ 0 \\\\ -1\\end{bmatrix},\\hspace{1em}{\\mathbf{a}}_{\\mathbf{3}}=\\begin{bmatrix}2 \\\\ 5 \\\\ 1\\end{bmatrix},\\hspace{1em}\\mathbf{b}=\\begin{bmatrix}-5 \\\\ -10 \\\\ 1\\end{bmatrix}.\n$$\n\nIf ${x}_{1}{\\mathbf{a}}_{1}+{x}_{2}{\\mathbf{a}}_{2}+{x}_{3}{\\mathbf{a}}_{3}=\\mathbf{b},$ then what is ${x}_{1}+{x}_{2}+{x}_{3}?$" :question/worked-solution "If ${x}_{1}{\\mathbf{a}}_{\\mathbf{1}}+{x}_{2}{\\mathbf{a}}_{\\mathbf{2}}+{x}_{3}{\\mathbf{a}}_{\\mathbf{3}}=\\mathbf{b}$, then we have\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{x}_{1}\\begin{bmatrix}1 \\\\ 0 \\\\ 3\\end{bmatrix}+{x}_{2}\\begin{bmatrix}-1 \\\\ 0 \\\\ -1\\end{bmatrix}+{x}_{3}\\begin{bmatrix}2 \\\\ 5 \\\\ 1\\end{bmatrix} & =\\begin{bmatrix}-5 \\\\ -10 \\\\ 1\\end{bmatrix} \\\\ \\begin{bmatrix}{x}_{1} \\\\ 0 \\\\ 3{x}_{1}\\end{bmatrix}+\\begin{bmatrix}-{x}_{2} \\\\ 0 \\\\ -{x}_{2}\\end{bmatrix}+\\begin{bmatrix}2{x}_{3} \\\\ 5{x}_{3} \\\\ {x}_{3}\\end{bmatrix} & =\\begin{bmatrix}-5 \\\\ -10 \\\\ 1\\end{bmatrix} \\\\ \\begin{bmatrix}{x}_{1}-{x}_{2}+2{x}_{3} \\\\ 5{x}_{3} \\\\ 3{x}_{1}-{x}_{2}+{x}_{3}\\end{bmatrix} & =\\begin{bmatrix}-5 \\\\ -10 \\\\ 1\\end{bmatrix}.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nEquating the corresponding components, we get the following system:\n\n$$\n\\left\\{\\begin{aligned}{x}_{1}-{x}_{2}+2{x}_{3} &=-5 \\\\ 5{x}_{3} &=-10 \\\\ 3{x}_{1}-{x}_{2}+{x}_{3} &=1\\end{aligned}\\right.\n$$\n\nWe will solve this system using Gaussian elimination. First, we write the augmented matrix for this system:\n\n$$\nM=\\left[\\begin{array}{ccc|c}1 & -1 & 2 & -5 \\\\ 0 & 0 & 5 & -10 \\\\ 3 & -1 & 1 & 1\\end{array}\\right]\n$$\n\nRow-reducing the augmented matrix, we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}M & =\\left[\\begin{array}{ccc|c}1 & -1 & 2 & -5 \\\\ 0 & 0 & 5 & -10 \\\\ 3 & -1 & 1 & 1\\end{array}\\right] & {R}_{3} & :={R}_{3}-3{R}_{1} \\\\  & ∼\\left[\\begin{array}{ccc|c}1 & -1 & 2 & -5 \\\\ 0 & 0 & 5 & -10 \\\\ 0 & 2 & -5 & 16\\end{array}\\right] & {R}_{2} & ↔{R}_{3} \\\\  & ∼\\left[\\begin{array}{ccc|c}1 & -1 & 2 & -5 \\\\ 0 & 2 & -5 & 16 \\\\ 0 & 0 & 5 & -10\\end{array}\\right] & {R}_{2} & :=\\frac{1}{2}{R}_{2} \\\\  & ∼\\left[\\begin{array}{ccc|c}1 & -1 & 2 & -5 \\\\ 0 & 1 & -2.5 & 8 \\\\ 0 & 0 & 5 & -10\\end{array}\\right] & {R}_{3} & :=\\frac{1}{5}{R}_{3} \\\\  & ∼\\left[\\begin{array}{ccc|c}1 & -1 & 2 & -5 \\\\ 0 & 1 & -2.5 & 8 \\\\ 0 & 0 & 1 & -2\\end{array}\\right].\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nThe system is now \n\n$$\n\\left\\{\\begin{aligned}{x}_{1}-{x}_{2}+2{x}_{3} &=-5 \\\\ {x}_{2}-2.5\\,{x}_{3} &=8 \\\\ {x}_{3} &=-2.\\end{aligned}\\right.\n$$\n\nFrom the third equation, we get ${x}_{3}=-2.$ Substituting this value into the second equation, we get \n\n$$\n{x}_{2}-2.5(-2)=8\\,⟹\\,{x}_{2}=8-5=3.\n$$\n\nFinally,  substituting ${x}_{2}=3$ and ${x}_{3}=-2$  into the first equation, we obtain\n\n$$\n{x}_{1}-(3)+2(-2)=-5\\,⟹\\,{x}_{1}=2.\n$$\n\nSo, the solution of the system is ${x}_{1}=2$, ${x}_{2}=3$, and ${x}_{3}=-2,$ which means \n\n$$\n2{\\mathbf{a}}_{\\mathbf{1}}+3{\\mathbf{a}}_{\\mathbf{2}}-2{\\mathbf{a}}_{\\mathbf{3}}=\\mathbf{b}.\n$$\n\nConsequently, \n\n$$\n{x}_{1}+{x}_{2}+{x}_{3}=2+3-2=3.\n$$"} {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186342130 :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "0ca1e367-7e59-5b69-861b-8c5df685d98a" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "-12" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186339240} {:answer/id #uuid "70e98200-2ef8-5fee-9135-1a64cdf08565" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "7" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186340130} {:answer/id #uuid "a0f91210-c308-5ac5-8b5f-ecea8232309c" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "14" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186340589} {:answer/id #uuid "cd78319b-964c-5a76-83e0-5cc4ba5b698b" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "No solution" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186340951} {:answer/id #uuid "d5c0ee9d-d678-5d90-ac70-ae36c44cd666" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "-7" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186341020}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "cd78319b-964c-5a76-83e0-5cc4ba5b698b" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "No solution" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186340951} :answer-field/id #uuid "d6466acd-a8cc-51d2-bb7d-d48bfacf96c3" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type {:db/ident :answer-field.type/radio} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186341757}] :question/difficulty {:db/ident :question.difficulty/hard} :question/id #uuid "ff5142a4-ab7b-5300-baa5-14f6253ed7fa" :question/math-academy-id "q-74006" :question/problem "Consider the vectors\n\n$$\n{\\mathbf{a}}_{\\mathbf{1}}=\\begin{bmatrix}1 \\\\ 0 \\\\ 1\\end{bmatrix},\\hspace{1em}{\\mathbf{a}}_{\\mathbf{2}}=\\begin{bmatrix}2 \\\\ -1 \\\\ -1\\end{bmatrix},\\hspace{1em}{\\mathbf{a}}_{\\mathbf{3}}=\\begin{bmatrix}0 \\\\ -1 \\\\ -3\\end{bmatrix},\\hspace{1em}\\mathbf{b}=\\begin{bmatrix}-2 \\\\ 5 \\\\ 1\\end{bmatrix}.\n$$\n\nIf ${x}_{1}{\\mathbf{a}}_{1}+{x}_{2}{\\mathbf{a}}_{2}+{x}_{3}{\\mathbf{a}}_{3}=\\mathbf{b},$ then what is ${x}_{1}+{x}_{2}+{x}_{3}?$" :question/worked-solution "If ${x}_{1}{\\mathbf{a}}_{1}+{x}_{2}{\\mathbf{a}}_{2}+{x}_{3}{\\mathbf{a}}_{3}=\\mathbf{b},$ then   we have\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{x}_{1}\\begin{bmatrix}1 \\\\ 0 \\\\ 1\\end{bmatrix}+{x}_{2}\\begin{bmatrix}2 \\\\ -1 \\\\ -1\\end{bmatrix}+{x}_{3}\\begin{bmatrix}0 \\\\ -1 \\\\ -3\\end{bmatrix} & =\\begin{bmatrix}-2 \\\\ 5 \\\\ 1\\end{bmatrix} \\\\ \\begin{bmatrix}{x}_{1} \\\\ 0 \\\\ {x}_{1}\\end{bmatrix}+\\begin{bmatrix}2{x}_{2} \\\\ -{x}_{2} \\\\ -{x}_{2}\\end{bmatrix}+\\begin{bmatrix}0 \\\\ -{x}_{3} \\\\ -3{x}_{3}\\end{bmatrix} & =\\begin{bmatrix}-2 \\\\ 5 \\\\ 1\\end{bmatrix} \\\\ \\begin{bmatrix}{x}_{1}+2{x}_{2} \\\\ -{x}_{2}-{x}_{3} \\\\ {x}_{1}-{x}_{2}-3{x}_{3}\\end{bmatrix} & =\\begin{bmatrix}-2 \\\\ 5 \\\\ 1\\end{bmatrix}.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nEquating the corresponding components, we get the following system:\n\n$$\n\\left\\{\\begin{aligned}{x}_{1}+2{x}_{2} &=-2 \\\\ -{x}_{2}-{x}_{3} &=5 \\\\ {x}_{1}-{x}_{2}-3{x}_{3} &=1\\end{aligned}\\right.\n$$\n\nWe will solve this system using Gaussian elimination. First, we write the augmented matrix for this system:\n\n$$\nM=\\left[\\begin{array}{ccc|c}1 & 2 & 0 & -2 \\\\ 0 & -1 & -1 & 5 \\\\ 1 & -1 & -3 & 1\\end{array}\\right].\n$$\n\nRow-reducing the augmented matrix, we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}M & =\\left[\\begin{array}{ccc|c}1 & 2 & 0 & -2 \\\\ 0 & -1 & -1 & 5 \\\\ 1 & -1 & -3 & 1\\end{array}\\right] & {R}_{3} & :={R}_{3}+(-1){R}_{1} \\\\  & ∼\\left[\\begin{array}{ccc|c}1 & 2 & 0 & -2 \\\\ 0 & -1 & -1 & 5 \\\\ 0 & -3 & -3 & 3\\end{array}\\right] & {R}_{2} & :=(-1){R}_{2} \\\\  & ∼\\left[\\begin{array}{ccc|c}1 & 2 & 0 & -2 \\\\ 0 & 1 & 1 & -5 \\\\ 0 & -3 & -3 & 3\\end{array}\\right] & {R}_{3} & :={R}_{3}+3{R}_{2} \\\\  & ∼\\left[\\begin{array}{ccc|c}1 & 2 & 0 & -2 \\\\ 0 & 1 & 1 & -5 \\\\ 0 & 0 & 0 & -12\\end{array}\\right].\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nThe system is now \n\n$$\n\\left\\{\\begin{aligned}{x}_{1}+2{x}_{2} &=-2 \\\\ {x}_{2}+{x}_{3} &=-5 \\\\ 0 &=-12.\\end{aligned}\\right.\n$$\n\nHowever, the final equation $0=-12$  gives a false statement. So the system has no solution."} {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186342132 :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "0cd5d137-daee-5d6d-98d8-3497a80c61ea" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "-1" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186339245} {:answer/id #uuid "1d07c66f-c54f-5a22-89c4-35d7095387f8" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "7" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186339379} {:answer/id #uuid "87f4b2e6-5682-5dda-9d57-6cd28ab535f2" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "3" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186340346} {:answer/id #uuid "90e508ef-9eec-5c7a-8be0-834a65ad1d3d" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "No solution" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186340427} {:answer/id #uuid "9316673f-9aac-5adc-b91d-046d54518f3f" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "2" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186340450}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "87f4b2e6-5682-5dda-9d57-6cd28ab535f2" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "3" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186340346} :answer-field/id #uuid "2eff5ea8-b869-5727-bf8d-1f462e27220d" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type {:db/ident :answer-field.type/radio} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186341460}] :question/difficulty {:db/ident :question.difficulty/moderate} :question/id #uuid "6ca28715-77ca-55f5-9aad-4851b6f70f79" :question/math-academy-id "q-74028" :question/problem "Consider the vectors\n\n$$\n{\\mathbf{a}}_{\\mathbf{1}}=\\begin{bmatrix}1 \\\\ 0 \\\\ 1\\end{bmatrix},\\hspace{1em}{\\mathbf{a}}_{\\mathbf{2}}=\\begin{bmatrix}1 \\\\ 3 \\\\ 1\\end{bmatrix},\\hspace{1em}{\\mathbf{a}}_{\\mathbf{3}}=\\begin{bmatrix}3 \\\\ 3 \\\\ 1\\end{bmatrix},\\hspace{1em}\\mathbf{b}=\\begin{bmatrix}-1 \\\\ -9 \\\\ 1\\end{bmatrix}.\n$$\n\nIf ${x}_{1}{\\mathbf{a}}_{1}+{x}_{2}{\\mathbf{a}}_{2}+{x}_{3}{\\mathbf{a}}_{3}=\\mathbf{b},$ then what is ${x}_{1}+{x}_{2}-{x}_{3}?$" :question/worked-solution "If ${x}_{1}{\\mathbf{a}}_{\\mathbf{1}}+{x}_{2}{\\mathbf{a}}_{\\mathbf{2}}+{x}_{3}{\\mathbf{a}}_{\\mathbf{3}}=\\mathbf{b}$, then we have\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{x}_{1}\\begin{bmatrix}1 \\\\ 0 \\\\ 1\\end{bmatrix}+{x}_{2}\\begin{bmatrix}1 \\\\ 3 \\\\ 1\\end{bmatrix}+{x}_{3}\\begin{bmatrix}3 \\\\ 3 \\\\ 1\\end{bmatrix} & =\\begin{bmatrix}-1 \\\\ -9 \\\\ 1\\end{bmatrix} \\\\ \\begin{bmatrix}{x}_{1} \\\\ 0 \\\\ {x}_{1}\\end{bmatrix}+\\begin{bmatrix}{x}_{2} \\\\ 3{x}_{2} \\\\ {x}_{2}\\end{bmatrix}+\\begin{bmatrix}3{x}_{3} \\\\ 3{x}_{3} \\\\ {x}_{3}\\end{bmatrix} & =\\begin{bmatrix}-1 \\\\ -9 \\\\ 1\\end{bmatrix} \\\\ \\begin{bmatrix}{x}_{1}+{x}_{2}+3{x}_{3} \\\\ 3{x}_{2}+3{x}_{3} \\\\ {x}_{1}+{x}_{2}+{x}_{3}\\end{bmatrix} & =\\begin{bmatrix}-1 \\\\ -9 \\\\ 1\\end{bmatrix}.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nEquating the corresponding components, we get the following system:\n\n$$\n\\left\\{\\begin{aligned}{x}_{1}+{x}_{2}+3{x}_{3} &=-1 \\\\ 3{x}_{2}+3{x}_{3} &=-9 \\\\ {x}_{1}+{x}_{2}+{x}_{3} &=1\\end{aligned}\\right.\n$$\n\nWe will solve this system using Gaussian elimination. First, we write the augmented matrix for this system:\n\n$$\nM=\\left[\\begin{array}{ccc|c}1 & 1 & 3 & -1 \\\\ 0 & 3 & 3 & -9 \\\\ 1 & 1 & 1 & 1\\end{array}\\right].\n$$\n\nRow-reducing the augmented matrix, we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}M & =\\left[\\begin{array}{ccc|c}1 & 1 & 3 & -1 \\\\ 0 & 3 & 3 & -9 \\\\ 1 & 1 & 1 & 1\\end{array}\\right] & {R}_{3} & :={R}_{3}+(-1){R}_{1} \\\\  & ∼\\left[\\begin{array}{ccc|c}1 & 1 & 3 & -1 \\\\ 0 & 3 & 3 & -9 \\\\ 0 & 0 & -2 & 2\\end{array}\\right] & {R}_{2} & :=\\frac{1}{3}{R}_{2} \\\\  & ∼\\left[\\begin{array}{ccc|c}1 & 1 & 3 & -1 \\\\ 0 & 1 & 1 & -3 \\\\ 0 & 0 & -2 & 2\\end{array}\\right] & {R}_{3} & :=-\\frac{1}{2}{R}_{3} \\\\  & ∼\\left[\\begin{array}{ccc|c}1 & 1 & 3 & -1 \\\\ 0 & 1 & 1 & -3 \\\\ 0 & 0 & 1 & -1\\end{array}\\right].\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\n \n\nThe system is now \n\n$$\n\\left\\{\\begin{aligned}{x}_{1}+{x}_{2}+3{x}_{3} &=-1 \\\\ {x}_{2}+{x}_{3} &=-3 \\\\ {x}_{3} &=-1.\\end{aligned}\\right.\n$$\n\n \n\nFrom the third equation, we get ${x}_{3}=-1.$ Substituting this value into the second equation, we get\n\n$$\n{x}_{2}+(-1)=-3\\,⟹\\,{x}_{2}=-2.\n$$\n\nFinally, by substituting ${x}_{2}=-2,{x}_{3}=-1$ into the first equation, we obtain\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{x}_{1}+{x}_{2}+3{x}_{3} & =-1 \\\\ {x}_{1}+(-2)+3(-1) & =-1 \\\\ {x}_{1}-5 & =-1 \\\\ {x}_{1} & =4.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nSo, the solution of the system is ${x}_{1}=4$, ${x}_{2}=-2$, and ${x}_{3}=-1,$ which means \n\n$$\n4{\\mathbf{a}}_{\\mathbf{1}}-2{\\mathbf{a}}_{\\mathbf{2}}-{\\mathbf{a}}_{\\mathbf{3}}=\\mathbf{b}.\n$$\n\nConsequently, \n\n$$\n{x}_{1}+{x}_{2}-{x}_{3}=4+(-2)-(-1)=3.\n$$"} {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186342133 :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "0dd1e2d3-3d25-597c-a847-faa140432c9c" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "3" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186339255} {:answer/id #uuid "28a2b981-6db8-5f16-b21b-6ae088a23e3d" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "No solution" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186339484} {:answer/id #uuid "309c51a6-6646-55e5-a9ef-db0cd36bd5b0" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "1" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186339553} {:answer/id #uuid "732f8930-5de1-53c0-8f9f-0564fc2ea176" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "6" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186340149} {:answer/id #uuid "d7a94670-179b-5241-8088-b40d00d22100" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "2" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186341041}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "309c51a6-6646-55e5-a9ef-db0cd36bd5b0" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "1" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186339553} :answer-field/id #uuid "95f0dc3f-6280-5dbc-ad92-0375cafd9b79" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type {:db/ident :answer-field.type/radio} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186341644}] :question/difficulty {:db/ident :question.difficulty/moderate} :question/id #uuid "237520c7-3369-5c34-87a7-ba4be3c9b705" :question/math-academy-id "q-74032" :question/problem "Consider the vectors\n\n$$\n{\\mathbf{a}}_{\\mathbf{1}}=\\begin{bmatrix}1 \\\\ 0 \\\\ 1\\end{bmatrix},\\hspace{1em}{\\mathbf{a}}_{\\mathbf{2}}=\\begin{bmatrix}1 \\\\ -2 \\\\ 2\\end{bmatrix},\\hspace{1em}{\\mathbf{a}}_{\\mathbf{3}}=\\begin{bmatrix}3 \\\\ -11 \\\\ 1\\end{bmatrix},\\hspace{1em}\\mathbf{b}=\\begin{bmatrix}5 \\\\ -18 \\\\ -1\\end{bmatrix}.\n$$\n\nIf ${x}_{1}{\\mathbf{a}}_{1}+{x}_{2}{\\mathbf{a}}_{2}+{x}_{3}{\\mathbf{a}}_{3}=\\mathbf{b},$ then what is ${x}_{1}+{x}_{2}+{x}_{3}?$" :question/worked-solution "If ${x}_{1}{\\mathbf{a}}_{\\mathbf{1}}+{x}_{2}{\\mathbf{a}}_{\\mathbf{2}}+{x}_{3}{\\mathbf{a}}_{\\mathbf{3}}=\\mathbf{b}$, then we have\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{x}_{1}\\begin{bmatrix}1 \\\\ 0 \\\\ 1\\end{bmatrix}+{x}_{2}\\begin{bmatrix}1 \\\\ -2 \\\\ 2\\end{bmatrix}+{x}_{3}\\begin{bmatrix}3 \\\\ -11 \\\\ 1\\end{bmatrix} & =\\begin{bmatrix}5 \\\\ -18 \\\\ -1\\end{bmatrix} \\\\ \\begin{bmatrix}{x}_{1} \\\\ 0 \\\\ {x}_{1}\\end{bmatrix}+\\begin{bmatrix}{x}_{2} \\\\ -2{x}_{2} \\\\ 2{x}_{2}\\end{bmatrix}+\\begin{bmatrix}3{x}_{3} \\\\ -11{x}_{3} \\\\ {x}_{3}\\end{bmatrix} & =\\begin{bmatrix}5 \\\\ -18 \\\\ -1\\end{bmatrix} \\\\ \\begin{bmatrix}{x}_{1}+{x}_{2}+3{x}_{3} \\\\ -2{x}_{2}-11{x}_{3} \\\\ {x}_{1}+2{x}_{2}+{x}_{3}\\end{bmatrix} & =\\begin{bmatrix}5 \\\\ -18 \\\\ -1\\end{bmatrix}.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nEquating the corresponding components, we get the following system:\n\n$$\n\\left\\{\\begin{aligned}{x}_{1}+{x}_{2}+3{x}_{3} &=5 \\\\ -2{x}_{2}-11{x}_{3} &=-18 \\\\ {x}_{1}+2{x}_{2}+{x}_{3} &=-1\\end{aligned}\\right.\n$$\n\nWe will solve this system using Gaussian elimination. First, we write the augmented matrix for this system:\n\n$$\nM=\\left[\\begin{array}{ccc|c}1 & 1 & 3 & 5 \\\\ 0 & -2 & -11 & -18 \\\\ 1 & 2 & 1 & -1\\end{array}\\right].\n$$\n\nRow-reducing the augmented matrix, we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}M & =\\left[\\begin{array}{ccc|c}1 & 1 & 3 & 5 \\\\ 0 & -2 & -11 & -18 \\\\ 1 & 2 & 1 & -1\\end{array}\\right] & {R}_{3} & :={R}_{3}+(-1){R}_{1} \\\\  & ∼\\left[\\begin{array}{ccc|c}1 & 1 & 3 & 5 \\\\ 0 & -2 & -11 & -18 \\\\ 0 & 1 & -2 & -6\\end{array}\\right] & {R}_{2} & ↔{R}_{3} \\\\  & ∼\\left[\\begin{array}{ccc|c}1 & 1 & 3 & 5 \\\\ 0 & 1 & -2 & -6 \\\\ 0 & -2 & -11 & -18\\end{array}\\right] & {R}_{3} & :={R}_{3}+2{R}_{2} \\\\  & ∼\\left[\\begin{array}{ccc|c}1 & 1 & 3 & 5 \\\\ 0 & 1 & -2 & -6 \\\\ 0 & 0 & -15 & -30\\end{array}\\right] & {R}_{3} & :=-\\frac{1}{15}{R}_{3} \\\\  & ∼\\left[\\begin{array}{ccc|c}1 & 1 & 3 & 5 \\\\ 0 & 1 & -2 & -6 \\\\ 0 & 0 & 1 & 2\\end{array}\\right].\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\n \n\nThe system is now \n\n$$\n\\left\\{\\begin{aligned}{x}_{1}+{x}_{2}+3{x}_{3} &=5 \\\\ {x}_{2}-2{x}_{3} &=-6 \\\\ {x}_{3} &=2.\\end{aligned}\\right.\n$$\n\n \n\nFrom the third equation, we get ${x}_{3}=2.$ Substituting this value into  the second equation, we get\n\n$$\n{x}_{2}-2(2)=-6\\,⟹\\,{x}_{2}=-2.\n$$\n\n \n\nFinally, by substituting ${x}_{2}=-2$ and ${x}_{3}=2$ into the first equation, we obtain \n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{x}_{1}+{x}_{2}+3{x}_{3} & =5 \\\\ {x}_{1}+(-2)+3(2) & =5 \\\\ {x}_{1}+4 & =5 \\\\ {x}_{1} & =1.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nSo, the solution of the system is ${x}_{1}=1$, ${x}_{2}=-2$, and ${x}_{3}=2,$ which means \n\n$$\n{\\mathbf{a}}_{\\mathbf{1}}-2{\\mathbf{a}}_{\\mathbf{2}}+2{\\mathbf{a}}_{\\mathbf{3}}=\\mathbf{b}.\n$$\n\nConsequently, \n\n$$\n{x}_{1}+{x}_{2}+{x}_{3}=1+(-2)+2=1.\n$$"} {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186342134 :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "4c3b744a-01a9-54ce-8529-5a08f78940d9" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "2" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186339816} {:answer/id #uuid "60e09ff1-d3cc-58ef-8987-5a5f148e2536" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "No solution" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186339992} {:answer/id #uuid "8a3631e7-ceb5-57d9-884a-4e22407dcb9d" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "-4" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186340363} {:answer/id #uuid "9ad3c54b-5811-537d-84b5-61c05d4666df" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "4" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186340526} {:answer/id #uuid "a932259c-57be-54ad-a6fe-9cb2e6f3f068" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "-2" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186340667}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "a932259c-57be-54ad-a6fe-9cb2e6f3f068" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "-2" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186340667} :answer-field/id #uuid "84898483-2191-5459-b5c9-62b59dd71df8" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type {:db/ident :answer-field.type/radio} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186341612}] :question/difficulty {:db/ident :question.difficulty/moderate} :question/id #uuid "118e9ea0-84b3-5e8f-866f-104da032b6d7" :question/math-academy-id "q-74035" :question/problem "Consider the vectors\n\n$$\n{\\mathbf{a}}_{\\mathbf{1}}=\\begin{bmatrix}1 \\\\ 0 \\\\ 3\\end{bmatrix},\\hspace{1em}{\\mathbf{a}}_{\\mathbf{2}}=\\begin{bmatrix}-1 \\\\ 5 \\\\ 2\\end{bmatrix},\\hspace{1em}{\\mathbf{a}}_{\\mathbf{3}}=\\begin{bmatrix}0 \\\\ 1 \\\\ 0\\end{bmatrix},\\hspace{1em}\\mathbf{b}=\\begin{bmatrix}-3 \\\\ 4 \\\\ -4\\end{bmatrix}.\n$$\n\nIf ${x}_{1}{\\mathbf{a}}_{1}+{x}_{2}{\\mathbf{a}}_{2}+{x}_{3}{\\mathbf{a}}_{3}=\\mathbf{b},$ then what is ${x}_{1}+{x}_{2}+{x}_{3}?$" :question/worked-solution "If ${x}_{1}{\\mathbf{a}}_{\\mathbf{1}}+{x}_{2}{\\mathbf{a}}_{\\mathbf{2}}+{x}_{3}{\\mathbf{a}}_{\\mathbf{3}}=\\mathbf{b}$, then we have\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{x}_{1}\\begin{bmatrix}1 \\\\ 0 \\\\ 3\\end{bmatrix}+{x}_{2}\\begin{bmatrix}-1 \\\\ 5 \\\\ 2\\end{bmatrix}+{x}_{3}\\begin{bmatrix}0 \\\\ 1 \\\\ 0\\end{bmatrix} & =\\begin{bmatrix}-3 \\\\ 4 \\\\ -4\\end{bmatrix} \\\\ \\begin{bmatrix}{x}_{1} \\\\ 0 \\\\ 3{x}_{1}\\end{bmatrix}+\\begin{bmatrix}-{x}_{2} \\\\ 5{x}_{2} \\\\ 2{x}_{2}\\end{bmatrix}+\\begin{bmatrix}0 \\\\ {x}_{3} \\\\ 0\\end{bmatrix} & =\\begin{bmatrix}-3 \\\\ 4 \\\\ -4\\end{bmatrix} \\\\ \\begin{bmatrix}{x}_{1}-{x}_{2} \\\\ 5{x}_{2}+{x}_{3} \\\\ 3{x}_{1}+2{x}_{2}\\end{bmatrix} & =\\begin{bmatrix}-3 \\\\ 4 \\\\ -4\\end{bmatrix}.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nEquating the corresponding components, we get the following system:\n\n$$\n\\left\\{\\begin{aligned}{x}_{1}-{x}_{2} &=-3 \\\\ 5{x}_{2}+{x}_{3} &=4 \\\\ 3{x}_{1}+2{x}_{2} &=-4\\end{aligned}\\right.\n$$\n\nWe will solve this system using Gaussian elimination. First, we write the augmented matrix for this system:\n\n$$\nM=\\left[\\begin{array}{ccc|c}1 & -1 & 0 & -3 \\\\ 0 & 5 & 1 & 4 \\\\ 3 & 2 & 0 & -4\\end{array}\\right]\n$$\n\nRow-reducing the augmented matrix, we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}M & =\\left[\\begin{array}{ccc|c}1 & -1 & 0 & -3 \\\\ 0 & 5 & 1 & 4 \\\\ 3 & 2 & 0 & -4\\end{array}\\right] & {R}_{3} & :={R}_{3}+(-3){R}_{1} \\\\  & ∼\\left[\\begin{array}{ccc|c}1 & -1 & 0 & -3 \\\\ 0 & 5 & 1 & 4 \\\\ 0 & 5 & 0 & 5\\end{array}\\right] & {R}_{3} & :={R}_{3}+(-1){R}_{2} \\\\  & ∼\\left[\\begin{array}{ccc|c}1 & -1 & 0 & -3 \\\\ 0 & 5 & 1 & 4 \\\\ 0 & 0 & -1 & 1\\end{array}\\right] & {R}_{2} & :=\\frac{1}{5}{R}_{2} \\\\  & ∼\\left[\\begin{array}{ccc|c}1 & -1 & 0 & -3 \\\\ 0 & 1 & 0.2 & 0.8 \\\\ 0 & 0 & -1 & 1\\end{array}\\right] & {R}_{3} & :=-{R}_{3} \\\\  & ∼\\left[\\begin{array}{ccc|c}1 & -1 & 0 & -3 \\\\ 0 & 1 & 0.2 & 0.8 \\\\ 0 & 0 & 1 & -1\\end{array}\\right].\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nThe system is now \n\n$$\n\\left\\{\\begin{aligned}{x}_{1}-{x}_{2} &=-3 \\\\ {x}_{2}+\\,0.2{x}_{3} &=0.8 \\\\ {x}_{3} &=-1.\\end{aligned}\\right.\n$$\n\nFrom the third equation, we get ${x}_{3}=-1.$ Substituting this value into the second equation, we get \n\n$$\n{x}_{2}+0.2(-1)=0.8\\,⟹\\,{x}_{2}=1.\n$$\n\n   \n\nFinally,  substituting ${x}_{2}=1$ into the first equation, we obtain\n\n$$\n{x}_{1}-(1)=-3\\,⟹\\,{x}_{1}=-2.\n$$\n\nSo, the solution of the system is ${x}_{1}=-2$, ${x}_{2}=1$, and ${x}_{3}=-1,$ which means  \n\n$$\n-2{\\mathbf{a}}_{\\mathbf{1}}+{\\mathbf{a}}_{\\mathbf{2}}-{\\mathbf{a}}_{\\mathbf{3}}=\\mathbf{b}.\n$$\n\nConsequently, \n\n$$\n{x}_{1}+{x}_{2}+{x}_{3}=-2+1-1=-2.\n$$"} {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186342138 :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "11e315df-67b1-5a51-8722-8b611d6b4f04" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "14" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186339284} {:answer/id #uuid "63215e56-f763-5d47-ad93-5bf665123767" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "15" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186340010} {:answer/id #uuid "cb20f6ae-be9d-53d3-9a62-422bcfb9533a" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "No solution" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186340927} {:answer/id #uuid "e2f1ab45-f348-545f-bf2c-ba9c88f197d8" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "10" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186341136} {:answer/id #uuid "f0ac09fc-fbae-5dfd-bb2b-94215e0d375c" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "12" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186341248}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "f0ac09fc-fbae-5dfd-bb2b-94215e0d375c" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "12" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186341248} :answer-field/id #uuid "f04b6cf2-abe9-50ed-8eee-447e512fcc60" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type {:db/ident :answer-field.type/radio} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186341811}] :question/difficulty {:db/ident :question.difficulty/moderate} :question/id #uuid "a8d414ab-92e5-5218-83d9-6fd3ed558d87" :question/math-academy-id "q-74046" :question/problem "Consider the vectors\n\n$$\n{\\mathbf{a}}_{\\mathbf{1}}=\\begin{bmatrix}1 \\\\ 0 \\\\ 2\\end{bmatrix},\\hspace{1em}{\\mathbf{a}}_{\\mathbf{2}}=\\begin{bmatrix}0 \\\\ 1 \\\\ -1\\end{bmatrix},\\hspace{1em}{\\mathbf{a}}_{\\mathbf{3}}=\\begin{bmatrix}1 \\\\ -2 \\\\ 0\\end{bmatrix},\\hspace{1em}\\mathbf{b}=\\begin{bmatrix}8 \\\\ -6 \\\\ 2\\end{bmatrix}.\n$$\n\nIf ${x}_{1}{\\mathbf{a}}_{1}+{x}_{2}{\\mathbf{a}}_{2}+{x}_{3}{\\mathbf{a}}_{3}=\\mathbf{b},$ then what is ${x}_{1}+{x}_{2}+{x}_{3}?$" :question/worked-solution "If ${x}_{1}{\\mathbf{a}}_{\\mathbf{1}}+{x}_{2}{\\mathbf{a}}_{\\mathbf{2}}+{x}_{3}{\\mathbf{a}}_{\\mathbf{3}}=\\mathbf{b}$, then we have\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{x}_{1}\\begin{bmatrix}1 \\\\ 0 \\\\ 2\\end{bmatrix}+{x}_{2}\\begin{bmatrix}0 \\\\ 1 \\\\ -1\\end{bmatrix}+{x}_{3}\\begin{bmatrix}1 \\\\ -2 \\\\ 0\\end{bmatrix} & =\\begin{bmatrix}8 \\\\ -6 \\\\ 2\\end{bmatrix} \\\\ \\begin{bmatrix}{x}_{1} \\\\ 0 \\\\ 2{x}_{1}\\end{bmatrix}+\\begin{bmatrix}0 \\\\ {x}_{2} \\\\ -{x}_{2}\\end{bmatrix}+\\begin{bmatrix}{x}_{3} \\\\ -2{x}_{3} \\\\ 0\\end{bmatrix} & =\\begin{bmatrix}8 \\\\ -6 \\\\ 2\\end{bmatrix} \\\\ \\begin{bmatrix}{x}_{1}+{x}_{3} \\\\ {x}_{2}-2{x}_{3} \\\\ 2{x}_{1}-{x}_{2}\\end{bmatrix} & =\\begin{bmatrix}8 \\\\ -6 \\\\ 2\\end{bmatrix}.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nEquating the corresponding components, we get the following system:\n\n$$\n\\left\\{\\begin{aligned}{x}_{1}+{x}_{3} &=8 \\\\ {x}_{2}-2{x}_{3} &=-6 \\\\ 2{x}_{1}-{x}_{2} &=2\\end{aligned}\\right.\n$$\n\nWe will solve this system using Gaussian elimination. First, we write the augmented matrix for this system:\n\n$$\nM=\\left[\\begin{array}{ccc|c}1 & 0 & 1 & 8 \\\\ 0 & 1 & -2 & -6 \\\\ 2 & -1 & 0 & 2\\end{array}\\right]\n$$\n\nRow-reducing the augmented matrix, we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}M & =\\left[\\begin{array}{ccc|c}1 & 0 & 1 & 8 \\\\ 0 & 1 & -2 & -6 \\\\ 2 & -1 & 0 & 2\\end{array}\\right] & {R}_{3} & :={R}_{3}-2{R}_{1} \\\\  & ∼\\left[\\begin{array}{ccc|c}1 & 0 & 1 & 8 \\\\ 0 & 1 & -2 & -6 \\\\ 0 & -1 & -2 & -14\\end{array}\\right] & {R}_{3} & :={R}_{3}+{R}_{2} \\\\  & ∼\\left[\\begin{array}{ccc|c}1 & 0 & 1 & 8 \\\\ 0 & 1 & -2 & -6 \\\\ 0 & 0 & -4 & -20\\end{array}\\right] & {R}_{3} & :=-\\frac{1}{4}{R}_{3} \\\\  & ∼\\left[\\begin{array}{ccc|c}1 & 0 & 1 & 8 \\\\ 0 & 1 & -2 & -6 \\\\ 0 & 0 & 1 & 5\\end{array}\\right].\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nSo, the system is now \n\n$$\n\\left\\{\\begin{aligned}{x}_{1}+{x}_{3} &=8 \\\\ {x}_{2}-2{x}_{3} &=-6 \\\\ {x}_{3} &=5.\\end{aligned}\\right.\n$$\n\nFrom the third equation, we get ${x}_{3}=5.$ Substituting this value in the second and first equations, we obtain\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned} & {x}_{2}-2(5)=-6\\,⟹\\,{x}_{2}=4 \\\\  & {x}_{1}+5=8\\,⟹\\,{x}_{1}=3.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nSo, the solution of the system is ${x}_{1}=3$, ${x}_{2}=4$, and ${x}_{3}=5,$ which means \n\n$$\n3{\\mathbf{a}}_{\\mathbf{1}}+4{\\mathbf{a}}_{\\mathbf{2}}+5{\\mathbf{a}}_{\\mathbf{3}}=\\mathbf{b}.\n$$\n\nConsequently, \n\n$$\n{x}_{1}+{x}_{2}+{x}_{3}=3+4+5=12.\n$$"} {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186371499 :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "bf8efcb6-f1b1-576a-a750-35914835105a" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "13" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186371501} {:answer/id #uuid "f03805a7-390e-5218-9aba-0d3067bb4713" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "-10" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186371502} {:answer/id #uuid "9fc31602-b9d2-56f8-a57a-90749cf42c78" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "No solution" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186371503} {:answer/id #uuid "ea94efc8-3987-5798-8f16-29bc2348a033" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "2" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186371504} {:answer/id #uuid "c15415b1-26d3-51b7-9cfa-09a0452f811d" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "-6" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186371505}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "9fc31602-b9d2-56f8-a57a-90749cf42c78" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "No solution" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186371503} :answer-field/id #uuid "22d80b2a-30bb-5d27-bb13-817743c9301f" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type {:db/ident :answer-field.type/radio} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186371500}] :question/difficulty {:db/ident :question.difficulty/hard} :question/id #uuid "1eebc51b-6af1-57eb-9255-9e266158abc7" :question/math-academy-id "q-105171" :question/problem "Consider the vectors\n\n$$\n{\\mathbf{a}}_{\\mathbf{1}}=\\begin{bmatrix}1 \\\\ 2 \\\\ -1\\end{bmatrix},\\hspace{1em}{\\mathbf{a}}_{\\mathbf{2}}=\\begin{bmatrix}-5 \\\\ -8 \\\\ 5\\end{bmatrix},\\hspace{1em}{\\mathbf{a}}_{\\mathbf{3}}=\\begin{bmatrix}-1 \\\\ 2 \\\\ 1\\end{bmatrix},\\hspace{1em}\\mathbf{b}=\\begin{bmatrix}1 \\\\ 9 \\\\ 1\\end{bmatrix}.\n$$\n\nIf ${x}_{1}{\\mathbf{a}}_{1}+{x}_{2}{\\mathbf{a}}_{2}+{x}_{3}{\\mathbf{a}}_{3}=\\mathbf{b},$ then what is ${x}_{1}+{x}_{2}+{x}_{3}?$" :question/worked-solution "If ${x}_{1}{\\mathbf{a}}_{\\mathbf{1}}+{x}_{2}{\\mathbf{a}}_{\\mathbf{2}}+{x}_{3}{\\mathbf{a}}_{\\mathbf{3}}=\\mathbf{b}$, then we have\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{x}_{1}\\begin{bmatrix}1 \\\\ 2 \\\\ -1\\end{bmatrix}+{x}_{2}\\begin{bmatrix}-5 \\\\ -8 \\\\ 5\\end{bmatrix}+{x}_{3}\\begin{bmatrix}-1 \\\\ 2 \\\\ 1\\end{bmatrix} & =\\begin{bmatrix}1 \\\\ 9 \\\\ 1\\end{bmatrix} \\\\ \\begin{bmatrix}{x}_{1} \\\\ 2{x}_{1} \\\\ -{x}_{1}\\end{bmatrix}+\\begin{bmatrix}-5{x}_{2} \\\\ -8{x}_{2} \\\\ 5{x}_{2}\\end{bmatrix}+\\begin{bmatrix}-{x}_{3} \\\\ 2{x}_{3} \\\\ {x}_{3}\\end{bmatrix} & =\\begin{bmatrix}1 \\\\ 9 \\\\ 1\\end{bmatrix} \\\\ \\begin{bmatrix}{x}_{1}-5{x}_{2}-{x}_{3} \\\\ 2{x}_{1}-8{x}_{2}+2{x}_{3} \\\\ -{x}_{1}+5{x}_{2}+{x}_{3}\\end{bmatrix} & =\\begin{bmatrix}1 \\\\ 9 \\\\ 1\\end{bmatrix}.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nEquating the corresponding components, we get the following system:\n\n$$\n\\left\\{\\begin{aligned}{x}_{1}-5{x}_{2}-{x}_{3} &=1 \\\\ 2{x}_{1}-8{x}_{2}+2{x}_{3} &=9 \\\\ -{x}_{1}+5{x}_{2}+{x}_{3} &=1\\end{aligned}\\right.\n$$\n\nWe will solve this system using Gaussian elimination. First, we write the augmented matrix for this system:\n\n$$\nM=\\left[\\begin{array}{ccc|c}1 & -5 & -1 & 1 \\\\ 2 & -8 & 2 & 9 \\\\ -1 & 5 & 1 & 1\\end{array}\\right].\n$$\n\nRow-reducing the augmented matrix, we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}M & =\\left[\\begin{array}{ccc|c}1 & -5 & -1 & 1 \\\\ 2 & -8 & 2 & 9 \\\\ -1 & 5 & 1 & 1\\end{array}\\right] & {R}_{2} & :={R}_{2}+(-2){R}_{1} \\\\  & ∼\\left[\\begin{array}{ccc|c}1 & -5 & -1 & 1 \\\\ 0 & 2 & 4 & 7 \\\\ -1 & 5 & 1 & 1\\end{array}\\right] & {R}_{3} & :={R}_{3}+{R}_{1} \\\\  & ∼\\left[\\begin{array}{ccc|c}1 & -5 & -1 & 1 \\\\ 0 & 2 & 4 & 7 \\\\ 0 & 0 & 0 & 2\\end{array}\\right].\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nThe system is now \n\n$$\n\\left\\{\\begin{aligned}{x}_{1}-5{x}_{2}-{x}_{3} &=1 \\\\ 2{x}_{2}+4{x}_{3} &=7 \\\\ 0 &=2.\\end{aligned}\\right.\n$$\n\nHowever, the final equation $0=2$  gives a false statement. So the system has no solution."} {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186573926 :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "20fa005b-1cd6-5081-9086-3952281151c8" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "5" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186573461} {:answer/id #uuid "57674894-26ce-5222-bc39-0cec6a625ee3" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "4" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186573535} {:answer/id #uuid "893ad3db-46c5-5114-a0bf-164fbc2e553c" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "-3" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186573603} {:answer/id #uuid "b1679c37-12a9-5a57-8ad6-19234d8f62c4" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "6" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186573655} {:answer/id #uuid "e47ed6c4-56c5-56bd-aece-e96f46748978" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "No solution" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186573723}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "e47ed6c4-56c5-56bd-aece-e96f46748978" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "No solution" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186573723} :answer-field/id #uuid "2e982092-3b3a-580a-859e-11cdf69c0b10" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type {:db/ident :answer-field.type/radio} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186573788}] :question/difficulty {:db/ident :question.difficulty/hard} :question/id #uuid "cc7e6aad-0683-5027-b3d4-db532b43dae8" :question/math-academy-id "q-74011" :question/problem "Consider the vectors\n\n$$\n{a}_{1}=\\begin{bmatrix}1 \\\\ -1 \\\\ 0\\end{bmatrix},\\,{a}_{2}=\\begin{bmatrix}-2 \\\\ 3 \\\\ -1\\end{bmatrix},\\,{a}_{3}=\\begin{bmatrix}2 \\\\ 1 \\\\ -3\\end{bmatrix},\\,b=\\begin{bmatrix}1 \\\\ 0 \\\\ 1\\end{bmatrix}.\n$$\n\nIf ${x}_{1}{a}_{1}+{x}_{2}{a}_{2}+{x}_{3}{a}_{3}=b,$ then what is ${x}_{1}+{x}_{2}+{x}_{3}?$" :question/worked-solution "If ${x}_{1}{a}_{1}+{x}_{2}{a}_{2}+{x}_{3}{a}_{3}=b$, then we have\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{x}_{1}\\begin{bmatrix}1 \\\\ -1 \\\\ 0\\end{bmatrix}+{x}_{2}\\begin{bmatrix}-2 \\\\ 3 \\\\ -1\\end{bmatrix}+{x}_{3}\\begin{bmatrix}2 \\\\ 1 \\\\ -3\\end{bmatrix} & =\\begin{bmatrix}1 \\\\ 0 \\\\ 1\\end{bmatrix} \\\\ \\begin{bmatrix}{x}_{1} \\\\ -{x}_{1} \\\\ 0\\end{bmatrix}+\\begin{bmatrix}-2{x}_{2} \\\\ 3{x}_{2} \\\\ -{x}_{2}\\end{bmatrix}+\\begin{bmatrix}2{x}_{3} \\\\ {x}_{3} \\\\ -3{x}_{3}\\end{bmatrix} & =\\begin{bmatrix}1 \\\\ 0 \\\\ 1\\end{bmatrix} \\\\ \\begin{bmatrix}{x}_{1}-2{x}_{2}+2{x}_{3} \\\\ -{x}_{1}+3{x}_{2}+{x}_{3} \\\\ -{x}_{2}-3{x}_{3}\\end{bmatrix} & =\\begin{bmatrix}1 \\\\ 0 \\\\ 1\\end{bmatrix}.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nEquating the corresponding components, we get the following system:\n\n$$\n\\left\\{\\begin{aligned}{x}_{1}-2{x}_{2}+2{x}_{3} &=1 \\\\ -{x}_{1}+3{x}_{2}+{x}_{3} &=0 \\\\ -{x}_{2}-3{x}_{3} &=1\\end{aligned}\\right.\n$$\n\nWe will solve this system using Gaussian elimination. First, we write the augmented matrix for this system:\n\n$$\nM=\\left[\\begin{array}{ccc|c}1 & -2 & 2 & 1 \\\\ -1 & 3 & 1 & 0 \\\\ 0 & -1 & -3 & 1\\end{array}\\right].\n$$\n\nRow-reducing the augmented matrix, we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}M & =\\left[\\begin{array}{ccc|c}1 & -2 & 2 & 1 \\\\ -1 & 3 & 1 & 0 \\\\ 0 & -1 & -3 & 1\\end{array}\\right] & {R}_{2} & :={R}_{2}+{R}_{1} \\\\  & ∼\\left[\\begin{array}{ccc|c}1 & -2 & 2 & 1 \\\\ 0 & 1 & 3 & 1 \\\\ 0 & -1 & -3 & 1\\end{array}\\right] & {R}_{3} & :={R}_{3}+{R}_{2} \\\\  & ∼\\left[\\begin{array}{ccc|c}1 & -2 & 2 & 1 \\\\ 0 & 1 & 3 & 1 \\\\ 0 & 0 & 0 & 2\\end{array}\\right].\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nThe system is now \n\n$$\n\\left\\{\\begin{aligned}{x}_{1}-2{x}_{2}+2{x}_{3} &=1 \\\\ {x}_{2}+3{x}_{3} &=1 \\\\ 0 &=2.\\end{aligned}\\right.\n$$\n\n \n\nHowever, the final equation $0=2$  gives a false statement. So the system has no solution."} {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186573932 :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "3612f42b-0a38-5946-b9e8-052f69ef6865" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "8" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186573492} {:answer/id #uuid "6951f3cf-b1cc-52f0-8053-481a177d156d" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "9" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186573552} {:answer/id #uuid "80af8001-4176-59b0-a320-b4d9c58112b5" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "10" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186573593} {:answer/id #uuid "95896ab6-b57c-5779-a69a-7fc7f0cae1d6" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "No solution" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186573618} {:answer/id #uuid "dbe12096-f5e1-5d5a-bc70-4e3a5e7b7b3e" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "7" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186573712}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "6951f3cf-b1cc-52f0-8053-481a177d156d" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "9" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186573552} :answer-field/id #uuid "cea41100-341d-5e9c-b722-4fac6c11f9fa" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type {:db/ident :answer-field.type/radio} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186573847}] :question/difficulty {:db/ident :question.difficulty/moderate} :question/id #uuid "d6a42f32-3ff1-5799-9155-413fd42c36ff" :question/math-academy-id "q-74043" :question/problem "Consider the vectors\n\n$$\n{a}_{1}=\\begin{bmatrix}1 \\\\ 0 \\\\ 4\\end{bmatrix},\\,{a}_{2}=\\begin{bmatrix}-2 \\\\ -5 \\\\ -1\\end{bmatrix},\\,{a}_{3}=\\begin{bmatrix}3 \\\\ 11 \\\\ -2\\end{bmatrix},\\,b=\\begin{bmatrix}2 \\\\ -4 \\\\ 15\\end{bmatrix}.\n$$\n\nIf ${x}_{1}{a}_{1}+{x}_{2}{a}_{2}+{x}_{3}{a}_{3}=b,$ then what is ${x}_{1}+{x}_{2}+{x}_{3}?$" :question/worked-solution "If ${x}_{1}{a}_{1}+{x}_{2}{a}_{2}+{x}_{3}{a}_{3}=b$, then we have\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{x}_{1}\\begin{bmatrix}1 \\\\ 0 \\\\ 4\\end{bmatrix}+{x}_{2}\\begin{bmatrix}-2 \\\\ -5 \\\\ -1\\end{bmatrix}+{x}_{3}\\begin{bmatrix}3 \\\\ 11 \\\\ -2\\end{bmatrix} & =\\begin{bmatrix}2 \\\\ -4 \\\\ 15\\end{bmatrix} \\\\ \\begin{bmatrix}{x}_{1} \\\\ 0 \\\\ 4{x}_{1}\\end{bmatrix}+\\begin{bmatrix}-2{x}_{2} \\\\ -5{x}_{2} \\\\ -{x}_{2}\\end{bmatrix}+\\begin{bmatrix}3{x}_{3} \\\\ 11{x}_{3} \\\\ -2{x}_{3}\\end{bmatrix} & =\\begin{bmatrix}2 \\\\ -4 \\\\ 15\\end{bmatrix} \\\\ \\begin{bmatrix}{x}_{1}-2{x}_{2}+3{x}_{3} \\\\ -5{x}_{2}+11{x}_{3} \\\\ 4{x}_{1}-{x}_{2}-2{x}_{3}\\end{bmatrix} & =\\begin{bmatrix}2 \\\\ -4 \\\\ 15\\end{bmatrix}.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nEquating the corresponding components, we get the following system:\n\n$$\n\\left\\{\\begin{aligned}{x}_{1}-2{x}_{2}+3{x}_{3} &=2 \\\\ -5{x}_{2}+11{x}_{3} &=-4 \\\\ 4{x}_{1}-{x}_{2}-2{x}_{3} &=15\\end{aligned}\\right.\n$$\n\nWe will solve this system using Gaussian elimination. First, we write the augmented matrix for this system:\n\n$$\nM=\\left[\\begin{array}{ccc|c}1 & -2 & 3 & 2 \\\\ 0 & -5 & 11 & -4 \\\\ 4 & -1 & -2 & 15\\end{array}\\right]\n$$\n\nRow-reducing the augmented matrix, we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}M & =\\left[\\begin{array}{ccc|c}1 & -2 & 3 & 2 \\\\ 0 & -5 & 11 & -4 \\\\ 4 & -1 & -2 & 15\\end{array}\\right] & {R}_{3} & :={R}_{3}-4{R}_{1} \\\\  & ∼\\left[\\begin{array}{ccc|c}1 & -2 & 3 & 2 \\\\ 0 & -5 & 11 & -4 \\\\ 0 & 7 & -14 & 7\\end{array}\\right] & {R}_{3} & ↔{R}_{2} \\\\  & ∼\\left[\\begin{array}{ccc|c}1 & -2 & 3 & 2 \\\\ 0 & 7 & -14 & 7 \\\\ 0 & -5 & 11 & -4\\end{array}\\right] & {R}_{2} & :=\\frac{1}{7}{R}_{2} \\\\  & ∼\\left[\\begin{array}{ccc|c}1 & -2 & 3 & 2 \\\\ 0 & 1 & -2 & 1 \\\\ 0 & -5 & 11 & -4\\end{array}\\right] & {R}_{3} & :={R}_{3}+5{R}_{2} \\\\  & ∼\\left[\\begin{array}{ccc|c}1 & -2 & 3 & 2 \\\\ 0 & 1 & -2 & 1 \\\\ 0 & 0 & 1 & 1\\end{array}\\right].\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nSo, the system is now \n\n$$\n\\left\\{\\begin{aligned}{x}_{1}-2{x}_{2}+3{x}_{3} &=2 \\\\ {x}_{2}-2{x}_{3} &=1 \\\\ {x}_{3} &=1.\\end{aligned}\\right.\n$$\n\nFrom the third equation, we get ${x}_{3}=1.$ Substituting this value into the second equation, we get\n\n$$\n{x}_{2}-2(1)=1\\,⟹\\,{x}_{2}=3.\n$$\n\nFinally, by substituting ${x}_{2}=3$ and ${x}_{3}=1$  into the first equation, we obtain\n\n$$\n{x}_{1}-2(3)+3(1)=2\\,⟹\\,{x}_{1}=5.\n$$\n\nSo, the solution of the system is ${x}_{1}=5$, ${x}_{2}=3$, and ${x}_{3}=1,$ which means \n\n$$\n5{a}_{1}+3{a}_{2}+{a}_{3}=b.\n$$\n\nConsequently, \n\n$$\n{x}_{1}+{x}_{2}+{x}_{3}=5+3+1=9.\n$$"} {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186672951 :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "1c48c943-fba7-5b25-a278-0c2fba2a8b98" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "2" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186672955} {:answer/id #uuid "7ef92015-0f8a-5cc1-8bcb-6b3de588b866" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "0" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186672970} {:answer/id #uuid "bc42bfa6-a4d6-5880-a1e0-9cea06f9c78b" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "3" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186672976} {:answer/id #uuid "bec23894-6e76-568c-bb56-0bc2a4971e38" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "7" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186672977} {:answer/id #uuid "d77ad7b5-901d-5523-9f2f-306a8c425f04" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "4" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186672980}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "d77ad7b5-901d-5523-9f2f-306a8c425f04" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "4" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186672980} :answer-field/id #uuid "444e2302-60e7-53c5-9812-499b99b124cf" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type {:db/ident :answer-field.type/radio} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186672960}] :question/difficulty {:db/ident :question.difficulty/moderate} :question/id #uuid "12013e4b-0191-5e66-95f1-55d982cbb9e2" :question/problem "Consider the vectors\n\n$$\na_1=\\begin{bmatrix}1 \\\\ 3 \\\\ -2\\end{bmatrix},\\quad a_2=\\begin{bmatrix}-3 \\\\ -8 \\\\ 6\\end{bmatrix},\\quad a_3=\\begin{bmatrix}2 \\\\ 5 \\\\ -3\\end{bmatrix},\\quad b=\\begin{bmatrix}-4 \\\\ -10 \\\\ 8\\end{bmatrix}\n$$\n\nIf $x_1a_1+x_2a_2+x_3a_3=b,$ then what is $x_{1} + x_{2} + x_{3}?$" :question/worked-solution "If $x_1a_1+x_2a_2+x_3a_3=b$, then we have\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}x_1\\begin{bmatrix}1 \\\\ 3 \\\\ -2\\end{bmatrix}+x_2\\begin{bmatrix}-3 \\\\ -8 \\\\ 6\\end{bmatrix}+x_3\\begin{bmatrix}2 \\\\ 5 \\\\ -3\\end{bmatrix}&=\\begin{bmatrix}-4 \\\\ -10 \\\\ 8\\end{bmatrix} \\\\ \\begin{bmatrix}x_{1} \\\\ 3 x_{1} \\\\ - 2 x_{1}\\end{bmatrix}+\\begin{bmatrix}- 3 x_{2} \\\\ - 8 x_{2} \\\\ 6 x_{2}\\end{bmatrix}+\\begin{bmatrix}2 x_{3} \\\\ 5 x_{3} \\\\ - 3 x_{3}\\end{bmatrix}&=\\begin{bmatrix}-4 \\\\ -10 \\\\ 8\\end{bmatrix} \\\\ \\begin{bmatrix}x_{1} - 3 x_{2} + 2 x_{3} \\\\ 3 x_{1} - 8 x_{2} + 5 x_{3} \\\\ - 2 x_{1} + 6 x_{2} - 3 x_{3}\\end{bmatrix}&=\\begin{bmatrix}-4 \\\\ -10 \\\\ 8\\end{bmatrix}\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nEquating the corresponding components, we get the following system:\n\n$$\n\\left\\{\\begin{aligned}x_{1} - 3 x_{2} + 2 x_{3} &=-4 \\\\ 3 x_{1} - 8 x_{2} + 5 x_{3} &=-10 \\\\ - 2 x_{1} + 6 x_{2} - 3 x_{3} &=8\\end{aligned}\\right.\n$$\n\nWe will solve this system using Gaussian elimination. First, we write the augmented matrix for this system:\n\n$$\nM=\\left[\\begin{array}{ccc|c}1 & -3 & 2 & -4 \\\\ 3 & -8 & 5 & -10 \\\\ -2 & 6 & -3 & 8\\end{array}\\right]\n$$\n\nRow-reducing the augmented matrix, we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}M&=\\left[\\begin{array}{ccc|c}1 & -3 & 2 & -4 \\\\ 3 & -8 & 5 & -10 \\\\ -2 & 6 & -3 & 8\\end{array}\\right] \\\\ &\\sim \\left[\\begin{array}{ccc|c}1 & -3 & 2 & -4 \\\\ 0 & 1 & -1 & 2 \\\\ -2 & 6 & -3 & 8\\end{array}\\right] && R_{2}:=R_{2}+(-3)R_{1} \\\\ &\\sim \\left[\\begin{array}{ccc|c}1 & -3 & 2 & -4 \\\\ 0 & 1 & -1 & 2 \\\\ 0 & 0 & 1 & 0\\end{array}\\right] && R_{3}:=R_{3}+(2)R_{1}\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nThe system is now\n\n$$\n\\left\\{\\begin{aligned}x_{1} - 3 x_{2} + 2 x_{3} &=-4 \\\\ x_{2} - x_{3} &=2 \\\\ x_{3} &=0\\end{aligned}\\right.\n$$\n\nFrom the third equation, we get $x_3=0.$ Substituting this value into the second equation, we get\n\n$$\n1x_2+(-1)(0)=2\\quad\\Rightarrow\\quad x_2=2\n$$\n\nFinally, substituting these values into the first equation, we obtain\n\n$$\nx_1+(-3)(2)+(2)(0)=-4\\quad\\Rightarrow\\quad x_1=2\n$$\n\nSo, the solution of the system is $x_1=2$, $x_2=2$, $x_3=0$, which means\n\n$$\n2a_1+(2)a_2+(0)a_3=b.\n$$\n\nConsequently,\n\n$$\nx_{1} + x_{2} + x_{3}=(2)+(2)+(0)=4.\n$$\n\n"} {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186672953 :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "18c1d7c0-4074-506f-a309-8ad1b1e25b63" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "16" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186672954} {:answer/id #uuid "225cb7ae-802c-53b3-874f-adfcf2c89545" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "20" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186672956} {:answer/id #uuid "6ae87310-261b-52d6-824c-4b7bd87268b3" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "14" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186672967} {:answer/id #uuid "7860edbf-5a69-5a5a-94cb-322b35426715" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "No solution" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186672968} {:answer/id #uuid "a7aca1a3-1023-5681-8635-df7b109c61dd" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "22" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186672974}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "6ae87310-261b-52d6-824c-4b7bd87268b3" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "14" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186672967} :answer-field/id #uuid "f1a678d7-68b0-5ce9-9e7b-4518d00bd4f9" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type {:db/ident :answer-field.type/radio} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186672981}] :question/difficulty {:db/ident :question.difficulty/moderate} :question/id #uuid "147eac2c-3a83-52e6-bae8-a772d5a224e2" :question/problem "Consider the vectors\n\n$$\na_1=\\begin{bmatrix}1 \\\\ 0 \\\\ 3\\end{bmatrix},\\quad a_2=\\begin{bmatrix}-1 \\\\ 5 \\\\ 2\\end{bmatrix},\\quad a_3=\\begin{bmatrix}0 \\\\ 1 \\\\ 0\\end{bmatrix},\\quad b=\\begin{bmatrix}0 \\\\ 29 \\\\ 25\\end{bmatrix}\n$$\n\nIf $x_1a_1+x_2a_2+x_3a_3=b,$ then what is $x_{1} + x_{2} + x_{3}?$" :question/worked-solution "If $x_1a_1+x_2a_2+x_3a_3=b$, then we have\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}x_1\\begin{bmatrix}1 \\\\ 0 \\\\ 3\\end{bmatrix}+x_2\\begin{bmatrix}-1 \\\\ 5 \\\\ 2\\end{bmatrix}+x_3\\begin{bmatrix}0 \\\\ 1 \\\\ 0\\end{bmatrix}&=\\begin{bmatrix}0 \\\\ 29 \\\\ 25\\end{bmatrix} \\\\ \\begin{bmatrix}x_{1} \\\\ 0 \\\\ 3 x_{1}\\end{bmatrix}+\\begin{bmatrix}- x_{2} \\\\ 5 x_{2} \\\\ 2 x_{2}\\end{bmatrix}+\\begin{bmatrix}0 \\\\ x_{3} \\\\ 0\\end{bmatrix}&=\\begin{bmatrix}0 \\\\ 29 \\\\ 25\\end{bmatrix} \\\\ \\begin{bmatrix}x_{1} - x_{2} \\\\ 5 x_{2} + x_{3} \\\\ 3 x_{1} + 2 x_{2}\\end{bmatrix}&=\\begin{bmatrix}0 \\\\ 29 \\\\ 25\\end{bmatrix}\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nEquating the corresponding components, we get the following system:\n\n$$\n\\left\\{\\begin{aligned}x_{1} - x_{2} &=0 \\\\ 5 x_{2} + x_{3} &=29 \\\\ 3 x_{1} + 2 x_{2} &=25\\end{aligned}\\right.\n$$\n\nWe will solve this system using Gaussian elimination. First, we write the augmented matrix for this system:\n\n$$\nM=\\left[\\begin{array}{ccc|c}1 & -1 & 0 & 0 \\\\ 0 & 5 & 1 & 29 \\\\ 3 & 2 & 0 & 25\\end{array}\\right]\n$$\n\nRow-reducing the augmented matrix, we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}M&=\\left[\\begin{array}{ccc|c}1 & -1 & 0 & 0 \\\\ 0 & 5 & 1 & 29 \\\\ 3 & 2 & 0 & 25\\end{array}\\right] \\\\ &\\sim \\left[\\begin{array}{ccc|c}1 & -1 & 0 & 0 \\\\ 0 & 5 & 1 & 29 \\\\ 0 & 5 & 0 & 25\\end{array}\\right] && R_{3}:=R_{3}+(-3)R_{1} \\\\ &\\sim \\left[\\begin{array}{ccc|c}1 & -1 & 0 & 0 \\\\ 0 & 5 & 1 & 29 \\\\ 0 & 0 & -1 & -4\\end{array}\\right] && R_{3}:=R_{3}+(-1)R_{2} \\\\ &\\sim \\left[\\begin{array}{ccc|c}1 & -1 & 0 & 0 \\\\ 0 & 1 & \\frac{1}{5} & \\frac{29}{5} \\\\ 0 & 0 & -1 & -4\\end{array}\\right] && R_{2}:=\\left(\\frac{1}{5}\\right)R_{2} \\\\ &\\sim \\left[\\begin{array}{ccc|c}1 & -1 & 0 & 0 \\\\ 0 & 1 & \\frac{1}{5} & \\frac{29}{5} \\\\ 0 & 0 & 1 & 4\\end{array}\\right] && R_{3}:=(-1)R_{3}\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nThe system is now\n\n$$\n\\left\\{\\begin{aligned}x_{1} - x_{2} &=0 \\\\ x_{2} + \\frac{x_{3}}{5} &=\\frac{29}{5} \\\\ x_{3} &=4\\end{aligned}\\right.\n$$\n\nFrom the third equation, we get $x_3=4.$ Substituting this value into the second equation, we get\n\n$$\n1x_2+\\left(\\frac{1}{5}\\right)(4)=\\frac{29}{5}\\quad\\Rightarrow\\quad x_2=5\n$$\n\nFinally, substituting these values into the first equation, we obtain\n\n$$\nx_1+(-1)(5)+(0)(4)=0\\quad\\Rightarrow\\quad x_1=5\n$$\n\nSo, the solution of the system is $x_1=5$, $x_2=5$, $x_3=4$, which means\n\n$$\n5a_1+(5)a_2+(4)a_3=b.\n$$\n\nConsequently,\n\n$$\nx_{1} + x_{2} + x_{3}=(5)+(5)+(4)=14.\n$$\n\n"} {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186672958 :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "0481921c-737c-512b-9287-7a7e7cb48246" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "-4" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186672948} {:answer/id #uuid "14203d7c-5c1b-519d-a6d8-01ee09812ea9" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "No solution" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186672952} {:answer/id #uuid "5022b2c1-4ff2-51b3-aeab-4053ab5569ae" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "-16" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186672964} {:answer/id #uuid "c17cb451-9d86-5b97-8ed4-c51e4621dcc9" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "-10" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186672978} {:answer/id #uuid "fed86eaa-9594-5449-97ea-1ed3e3d20abb" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "-32" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186672982}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "0481921c-737c-512b-9287-7a7e7cb48246" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "-4" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186672948} :answer-field/id #uuid "36c4941a-359f-5703-b0fb-263c9065b383" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type {:db/ident :answer-field.type/radio} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186672959}] :question/difficulty {:db/ident :question.difficulty/moderate} :question/id #uuid "31a35ba8-70d4-56fd-99b3-1c7e27df0350" :question/problem "Consider the vectors\n\n$$\na_1=\\begin{bmatrix}1 \\\\ 0 \\\\ 1\\end{bmatrix},\\quad a_2=\\begin{bmatrix}-1 \\\\ 1 \\\\ 1\\end{bmatrix},\\quad a_3=\\begin{bmatrix}2 \\\\ 0 \\\\ 5\\end{bmatrix},\\quad b=\\begin{bmatrix}-2 \\\\ -1 \\\\ -4\\end{bmatrix}\n$$\n\nIf $x_1a_1+x_2a_2+x_3a_3=b,$ then what is $x_{1} + x_{2} + x_{3}?$" :question/worked-solution "If $x_1a_1+x_2a_2+x_3a_3=b$, then we have\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}x_1\\begin{bmatrix}1 \\\\ 0 \\\\ 1\\end{bmatrix}+x_2\\begin{bmatrix}-1 \\\\ 1 \\\\ 1\\end{bmatrix}+x_3\\begin{bmatrix}2 \\\\ 0 \\\\ 5\\end{bmatrix}&=\\begin{bmatrix}-2 \\\\ -1 \\\\ -4\\end{bmatrix} \\\\ \\begin{bmatrix}x_{1} \\\\ 0 \\\\ x_{1}\\end{bmatrix}+\\begin{bmatrix}- x_{2} \\\\ x_{2} \\\\ x_{2}\\end{bmatrix}+\\begin{bmatrix}2 x_{3} \\\\ 0 \\\\ 5 x_{3}\\end{bmatrix}&=\\begin{bmatrix}-2 \\\\ -1 \\\\ -4\\end{bmatrix} \\\\ \\begin{bmatrix}x_{1} - x_{2} + 2 x_{3} \\\\ x_{2} \\\\ x_{1} + x_{2} + 5 x_{3}\\end{bmatrix}&=\\begin{bmatrix}-2 \\\\ -1 \\\\ -4\\end{bmatrix}\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nEquating the corresponding components, we get the following system:\n\n$$\n\\left\\{\\begin{aligned}x_{1} - x_{2} + 2 x_{3} &=-2 \\\\ x_{2} &=-1 \\\\ x_{1} + x_{2} + 5 x_{3} &=-4\\end{aligned}\\right.\n$$\n\nWe will solve this system using Gaussian elimination. First, we write the augmented matrix for this system:\n\n$$\nM=\\left[\\begin{array}{ccc|c}1 & -1 & 2 & -2 \\\\ 0 & 1 & 0 & -1 \\\\ 1 & 1 & 5 & -4\\end{array}\\right]\n$$\n\nRow-reducing the augmented matrix, we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}M&=\\left[\\begin{array}{ccc|c}1 & -1 & 2 & -2 \\\\ 0 & 1 & 0 & -1 \\\\ 1 & 1 & 5 & -4\\end{array}\\right] \\\\ &\\sim \\left[\\begin{array}{ccc|c}1 & -1 & 2 & -2 \\\\ 0 & 1 & 0 & -1 \\\\ 0 & 2 & 3 & -2\\end{array}\\right] && R_{3}:=R_{3}+(-1)R_{1} \\\\ &\\sim \\left[\\begin{array}{ccc|c}1 & -1 & 2 & -2 \\\\ 0 & 1 & 0 & -1 \\\\ 0 & 0 & 3 & 0\\end{array}\\right] && R_{3}:=R_{3}+(-2)R_{2} \\\\ &\\sim \\left[\\begin{array}{ccc|c}1 & -1 & 2 & -2 \\\\ 0 & 1 & 0 & -1 \\\\ 0 & 0 & 1 & 0\\end{array}\\right] && R_{3}:=\\left(\\frac{1}{3}\\right)R_{3}\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nThe system is now\n\n$$\n\\left\\{\\begin{aligned}x_{1} - x_{2} + 2 x_{3} &=-2 \\\\ x_{2} &=-1 \\\\ x_{3} &=0\\end{aligned}\\right.\n$$\n\nFrom the third equation, we get $x_3=0.$ Substituting this value into the second equation, we get\n\n$$\n1x_2+(0)(0)=-1\\quad\\Rightarrow\\quad x_2=-1\n$$\n\nFinally, substituting these values into the first equation, we obtain\n\n$$\nx_1+(-1)(-1)+(2)(0)=-2\\quad\\Rightarrow\\quad x_1=-3\n$$\n\nSo, the solution of the system is $x_1=-3$, $x_2=-1$, $x_3=0$, which means\n\n$$\n-3a_1+(-1)a_2+(0)a_3=b.\n$$\n\nConsequently,\n\n$$\nx_{1} + x_{2} + x_{3}=(-3)+(-1)+(0)=-4.\n$$\n\n"} {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186672962 :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "27085e70-0921-54c4-85d2-4628ee37e871" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "-10" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186672957} {:answer/id #uuid "473b0fed-1baf-5b21-8e59-e7583c7470aa" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "No solution" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186672961} {:answer/id #uuid "6782314a-88a0-519e-a91f-9d0a9cae538e" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "-12" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186672965} {:answer/id #uuid "a333a6a9-cc20-5abc-aa8c-51674d9728ac" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "-7" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186672972} {:answer/id #uuid "a59128fb-80fd-5aa7-aaad-a02e92b6bcc1" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "-8" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186672973}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "a333a6a9-cc20-5abc-aa8c-51674d9728ac" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "-7" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186672972} :answer-field/id #uuid "6ad272bb-8da8-521d-847d-0e83e30ff80e" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type {:db/ident :answer-field.type/radio} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186672966}] :question/difficulty {:db/ident :question.difficulty/moderate} :question/id #uuid "4812b027-a24c-5d1f-aaeb-b5ef962ecb5e" :question/problem "Consider the vectors\n\n$$\na_1=\\begin{bmatrix}1 \\\\ 0 \\\\ 2\\end{bmatrix},\\quad a_2=\\begin{bmatrix}0 \\\\ 1 \\\\ -1\\end{bmatrix},\\quad a_3=\\begin{bmatrix}1 \\\\ -2 \\\\ 0\\end{bmatrix},\\quad b=\\begin{bmatrix}-3 \\\\ 4 \\\\ 6\\end{bmatrix}\n$$\n\nIf $x_1a_1+x_2a_2+x_3a_3=b,$ then what is $x_{1} + x_{2} + x_{3}?$" :question/worked-solution "If $x_1a_1+x_2a_2+x_3a_3=b$, then we have\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}x_1\\begin{bmatrix}1 \\\\ 0 \\\\ 2\\end{bmatrix}+x_2\\begin{bmatrix}0 \\\\ 1 \\\\ -1\\end{bmatrix}+x_3\\begin{bmatrix}1 \\\\ -2 \\\\ 0\\end{bmatrix}&=\\begin{bmatrix}-3 \\\\ 4 \\\\ 6\\end{bmatrix} \\\\ \\begin{bmatrix}x_{1} \\\\ 0 \\\\ 2 x_{1}\\end{bmatrix}+\\begin{bmatrix}0 \\\\ x_{2} \\\\ - x_{2}\\end{bmatrix}+\\begin{bmatrix}x_{3} \\\\ - 2 x_{3} \\\\ 0\\end{bmatrix}&=\\begin{bmatrix}-3 \\\\ 4 \\\\ 6\\end{bmatrix} \\\\ \\begin{bmatrix}x_{1} + x_{3} \\\\ x_{2} - 2 x_{3} \\\\ 2 x_{1} - x_{2}\\end{bmatrix}&=\\begin{bmatrix}-3 \\\\ 4 \\\\ 6\\end{bmatrix}\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nEquating the corresponding components, we get the following system:\n\n$$\n\\left\\{\\begin{aligned}x_{1} + x_{3} &=-3 \\\\ x_{2} - 2 x_{3} &=4 \\\\ 2 x_{1} - x_{2} &=6\\end{aligned}\\right.\n$$\n\nWe will solve this system using Gaussian elimination. First, we write the augmented matrix for this system:\n\n$$\nM=\\left[\\begin{array}{ccc|c}1 & 0 & 1 & -3 \\\\ 0 & 1 & -2 & 4 \\\\ 2 & -1 & 0 & 6\\end{array}\\right]\n$$\n\nRow-reducing the augmented matrix, we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}M&=\\left[\\begin{array}{ccc|c}1 & 0 & 1 & -3 \\\\ 0 & 1 & -2 & 4 \\\\ 2 & -1 & 0 & 6\\end{array}\\right] \\\\ &\\sim \\left[\\begin{array}{ccc|c}1 & 0 & 1 & -3 \\\\ 0 & 1 & -2 & 4 \\\\ 0 & -1 & -2 & 12\\end{array}\\right] && R_{3}:=R_{3}+(-2)R_{1} \\\\ &\\sim \\left[\\begin{array}{ccc|c}1 & 0 & 1 & -3 \\\\ 0 & 1 & -2 & 4 \\\\ 0 & 0 & -4 & 16\\end{array}\\right] && R_{3}:=R_{3}+(1)R_{2} \\\\ &\\sim \\left[\\begin{array}{ccc|c}1 & 0 & 1 & -3 \\\\ 0 & 1 & -2 & 4 \\\\ 0 & 0 & 1 & -4\\end{array}\\right] && R_{3}:=\\left(- \\frac{1}{4}\\right)R_{3}\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nThe system is now\n\n$$\n\\left\\{\\begin{aligned}x_{1} + x_{3} &=-3 \\\\ x_{2} - 2 x_{3} &=4 \\\\ x_{3} &=-4\\end{aligned}\\right.\n$$\n\nFrom the third equation, we get $x_3=-4.$ Substituting this value into the second equation, we get\n\n$$\n1x_2+(-2)(-4)=4\\quad\\Rightarrow\\quad x_2=-4\n$$\n\nFinally, substituting these values into the first equation, we obtain\n\n$$\nx_1+(0)(-4)+(1)(-4)=-3\\quad\\Rightarrow\\quad x_1=1\n$$\n\nSo, the solution of the system is $x_1=1$, $x_2=-4$, $x_3=-4$, which means\n\n$$\n1a_1+(-4)a_2+(-4)a_3=b.\n$$\n\nConsequently,\n\n$$\nx_{1} + x_{2} + x_{3}=(1)+(-4)+(-4)=-7.\n$$\n\n"} {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186672979 :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "05db9f38-531a-57a8-8ed6-1077065a7257" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "6" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186672949} {:answer/id #uuid "0a1e90e2-40e8-5636-bcdb-4019af4e4676" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "5" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186672950} {:answer/id #uuid "7a3a9230-e49c-5fb1-9181-6d935627f64b" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "No solution" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186672969} {:answer/id #uuid "8da8baf7-9cb4-597e-bb17-6e74d31ac70d" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "4" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186672971} {:answer/id #uuid "acecb867-93ec-5a33-b47e-b1744d7aa73b" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "9" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186672975}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "05db9f38-531a-57a8-8ed6-1077065a7257" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "6" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186672949} :answer-field/id #uuid "4841a2ba-e729-5d5a-9b30-9d8da775c96a" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type {:db/ident :answer-field.type/radio} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186672963}] :question/difficulty {:db/ident :question.difficulty/moderate} :question/id #uuid "cb3b6978-3983-5397-b56f-70c9f5f783c0" :question/problem "Consider the vectors\n\n$$\na_1=\\begin{bmatrix}1 \\\\ 0 \\\\ 1\\end{bmatrix},\\quad a_2=\\begin{bmatrix}1 \\\\ -2 \\\\ 2\\end{bmatrix},\\quad a_3=\\begin{bmatrix}3 \\\\ -11 \\\\ 1\\end{bmatrix},\\quad b=\\begin{bmatrix}14 \\\\ -48 \\\\ 8\\end{bmatrix}\n$$\n\nIf $x_1a_1+x_2a_2+x_3a_3=b,$ then what is $x_{1} + x_{2} + x_{3}?$" :question/worked-solution "If $x_1a_1+x_2a_2+x_3a_3=b$, then we have\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}x_1\\begin{bmatrix}1 \\\\ 0 \\\\ 1\\end{bmatrix}+x_2\\begin{bmatrix}1 \\\\ -2 \\\\ 2\\end{bmatrix}+x_3\\begin{bmatrix}3 \\\\ -11 \\\\ 1\\end{bmatrix}&=\\begin{bmatrix}14 \\\\ -48 \\\\ 8\\end{bmatrix} \\\\ \\begin{bmatrix}x_{1} \\\\ 0 \\\\ x_{1}\\end{bmatrix}+\\begin{bmatrix}x_{2} \\\\ - 2 x_{2} \\\\ 2 x_{2}\\end{bmatrix}+\\begin{bmatrix}3 x_{3} \\\\ - 11 x_{3} \\\\ x_{3}\\end{bmatrix}&=\\begin{bmatrix}14 \\\\ -48 \\\\ 8\\end{bmatrix} \\\\ \\begin{bmatrix}x_{1} + x_{2} + 3 x_{3} \\\\ - 2 x_{2} - 11 x_{3} \\\\ x_{1} + 2 x_{2} + x_{3}\\end{bmatrix}&=\\begin{bmatrix}14 \\\\ -48 \\\\ 8\\end{bmatrix}\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nEquating the corresponding components, we get the following system:\n\n$$\n\\left\\{\\begin{aligned}x_{1} + x_{2} + 3 x_{3} &=14 \\\\ - 2 x_{2} - 11 x_{3} &=-48 \\\\ x_{1} + 2 x_{2} + x_{3} &=8\\end{aligned}\\right.\n$$\n\nWe will solve this system using Gaussian elimination. First, we write the augmented matrix for this system:\n\n$$\nM=\\left[\\begin{array}{ccc|c}1 & 1 & 3 & 14 \\\\ 0 & -2 & -11 & -48 \\\\ 1 & 2 & 1 & 8\\end{array}\\right]\n$$\n\nRow-reducing the augmented matrix, we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}M&=\\left[\\begin{array}{ccc|c}1 & 1 & 3 & 14 \\\\ 0 & -2 & -11 & -48 \\\\ 1 & 2 & 1 & 8\\end{array}\\right] \\\\ &\\sim \\left[\\begin{array}{ccc|c}1 & 1 & 3 & 14 \\\\ 0 & -2 & -11 & -48 \\\\ 0 & 1 & -2 & -6\\end{array}\\right] && R_{3}:=R_{3}+(-1)R_{1} \\\\ &\\sim \\left[\\begin{array}{ccc|c}1 & 1 & 3 & 14 \\\\ 0 & 1 & -2 & -6 \\\\ 0 & -2 & -11 & -48\\end{array}\\right] && R_{2}\\leftrightarrow R_{3} \\\\ &\\sim \\left[\\begin{array}{ccc|c}1 & 1 & 3 & 14 \\\\ 0 & 1 & -2 & -6 \\\\ 0 & 0 & -15 & -60\\end{array}\\right] && R_{3}:=R_{3}+(2)R_{2} \\\\ &\\sim \\left[\\begin{array}{ccc|c}1 & 1 & 3 & 14 \\\\ 0 & 1 & -2 & -6 \\\\ 0 & 0 & 1 & 4\\end{array}\\right] && R_{3}:=\\left(- \\frac{1}{15}\\right)R_{3}\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nThe system is now\n\n$$\n\\left\\{\\begin{aligned}x_{1} + x_{2} + 3 x_{3} &=14 \\\\ x_{2} - 2 x_{3} &=-6 \\\\ x_{3} &=4\\end{aligned}\\right.\n$$\n\nFrom the third equation, we get $x_3=4.$ Substituting this value into the second equation, we get\n\n$$\n1x_2+(-2)(4)=-6\\quad\\Rightarrow\\quad x_2=2\n$$\n\nFinally, substituting these values into the first equation, we obtain\n\n$$\nx_1+(1)(2)+(3)(4)=14\\quad\\Rightarrow\\quad x_1=0\n$$\n\nSo, the solution of the system is $x_1=0$, $x_2=2$, $x_3=4$, which means\n\n$$\n0a_1+(2)a_2+(4)a_3=b.\n$$\n\nConsequently,\n\n$$\nx_{1} + x_{2} + x_{3}=(0)+(2)+(4)=6.\n$$\n\n"} {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186713085 :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "126fa37f-f3ba-554b-bcd7-f302dbb1d274" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "No solution" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186713086} {:answer/id #uuid "1408ce1a-f8df-5b01-96df-751d4a8be57f" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "4" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186713087} {:answer/id #uuid "85a47131-b57a-5840-a379-bc9c8fcb937b" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "2" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186713094} {:answer/id #uuid "b19a9a37-09be-57f9-ab94-af7e1c95f7ef" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "3" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186713096} {:answer/id #uuid "dfcc9d9c-0433-5a05-a925-e697da3c73ef" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "-2" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186713101}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "85a47131-b57a-5840-a379-bc9c8fcb937b" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "2" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186713094} :answer-field/id #uuid "3f456a33-11c6-5a00-96fa-3c13e55b96d4" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type {:db/ident :answer-field.type/radio} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186713089}] :question/difficulty {:db/ident :question.difficulty/easy} :question/id #uuid "1222c30a-fe2e-53b8-b113-8a05f9a87d4c" :question/problem "Consider the vectors\n\n$$\n\\mathbf{a}_1=\\begin{bmatrix}1 \\\\ 0 \\\\ 0\\end{bmatrix},\\quad \\mathbf{a}_2=\\begin{bmatrix}1 \\\\ 1 \\\\ 0\\end{bmatrix},\\quad \\mathbf{a}_3=\\begin{bmatrix}0 \\\\ 1 \\\\ 1\\end{bmatrix},\\quad \\mathbf{b}=\\begin{bmatrix}0 \\\\ 3 \\\\ 2\\end{bmatrix}\n$$\n\nIf $x_1\\mathbf{a}_1+x_2\\mathbf{a}_2+x_3\\mathbf{a}_3=\\mathbf{b}$, then what is $x_1+x_2+x_3$?" :question/worked-solution "Expanding the scalar multiples and adding corresponding components gives\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}x_1\\begin{bmatrix}1 \\\\ 0 \\\\ 0\\end{bmatrix}+x_2\\begin{bmatrix}1 \\\\ 1 \\\\ 0\\end{bmatrix}+x_3\\begin{bmatrix}0 \\\\ 1 \\\\ 1\\end{bmatrix}&=\\begin{bmatrix}0 \\\\ 3 \\\\ 2\\end{bmatrix} \\\\ \\begin{bmatrix}x_1 \\\\ 0 \\\\ 0\\end{bmatrix}+\\begin{bmatrix}x_2 \\\\ x_2 \\\\ 0\\end{bmatrix}+\\begin{bmatrix}0 \\\\ x_3 \\\\ x_3\\end{bmatrix}&=\\begin{bmatrix}0 \\\\ 3 \\\\ 2\\end{bmatrix} \\\\ \\begin{bmatrix}x_1+x_2 \\\\ x_2+x_3 \\\\ x_3\\end{bmatrix}&=\\begin{bmatrix}0 \\\\ 3 \\\\ 2\\end{bmatrix}\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nEquating corresponding components, we obtain\n\n$$\n\\left\\{\\begin{aligned}x_1+x_2 &=0 \\\\ x_2+x_3 &=3 \\\\ x_3 &=2\\end{aligned}\\right.\n$$\n\nThe augmented matrix is\n\n$$\nM=\\left[\\begin{array}{ccc|c}1 & 1 & 0 & 0 \\\\ 0 & 1 & 1 & 3 \\\\ 0 & 0 & 1 & 2\\end{array}\\right]\n$$\n\nThis matrix is already in row echelon form. Read the last equation first and substitute upward:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}x_3&=2 \\\\ x_2+2&=3 &&\\Rightarrow\\quad x_2=1 \\\\ x_1+1&=0 &&\\Rightarrow\\quad x_1=-1\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nThus\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}-\\mathbf{a}_1+\\mathbf{a}_2+2\\mathbf{a}_3&=\\mathbf{b}, \\\\ x_1+x_2+x_3&=-1+1+2=2.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\n"} {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186713092 :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "19b9ef9b-9012-580d-91b1-4ab59815a8dd" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "0" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186713088} {:answer/id #uuid "8e4eff19-ec85-597d-9087-0f7efa89ae1c" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "-2" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186713095} {:answer/id #uuid "c01c83b9-3c11-5337-bf58-70cac93e616b" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "No solution" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186713098} {:answer/id #uuid "d62f842b-e7ac-555f-8565-6243579f6850" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "-4" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186713100} {:answer/id #uuid "e8833afa-2d6c-5928-8477-b1a69bed93c9" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "2" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186713103}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "8e4eff19-ec85-597d-9087-0f7efa89ae1c" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "-2" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186713095} :answer-field/id #uuid "84f592ae-c982-5053-ab39-2214cff7e5c6" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type {:db/ident :answer-field.type/radio} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186713093}] :question/difficulty {:db/ident :question.difficulty/moderate} :question/id #uuid "7096ca78-7b70-5b3d-aed8-8000c04b7f29" :question/problem "Consider the vectors\n\n$$\n\\mathbf{a}_1=\\begin{bmatrix}1 \\\\ 3 \\\\ -2\\end{bmatrix},\\quad \\mathbf{a}_2=\\begin{bmatrix}-3 \\\\ -8 \\\\ 6\\end{bmatrix},\\quad \\mathbf{a}_3=\\begin{bmatrix}2 \\\\ 5 \\\\ -3\\end{bmatrix},\\quad \\mathbf{b}=\\begin{bmatrix}3 \\\\ 7 \\\\ -5\\end{bmatrix}\n$$\n\nIf $x_1\\mathbf{a}_1+x_2\\mathbf{a}_2+x_3\\mathbf{a}_3=\\mathbf{b}$, then what is $x_1+x_2+x_3$?" :question/worked-solution "Expanding the scalar multiples and adding corresponding components gives\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}x_1\\begin{bmatrix}1 \\\\ 3 \\\\ -2\\end{bmatrix}+x_2\\begin{bmatrix}-3 \\\\ -8 \\\\ 6\\end{bmatrix}+x_3\\begin{bmatrix}2 \\\\ 5 \\\\ -3\\end{bmatrix}&=\\begin{bmatrix}3 \\\\ 7 \\\\ -5\\end{bmatrix} \\\\ \\begin{bmatrix}x_1 \\\\ 3x_1 \\\\ -2x_1\\end{bmatrix}+\\begin{bmatrix}-3x_2 \\\\ -8x_2 \\\\ 6x_2\\end{bmatrix}+\\begin{bmatrix}2x_3 \\\\ 5x_3 \\\\ -3x_3\\end{bmatrix}&=\\begin{bmatrix}3 \\\\ 7 \\\\ -5\\end{bmatrix} \\\\ \\begin{bmatrix}x_1-3x_2+2x_3 \\\\ 3x_1-8x_2+5x_3 \\\\ -2x_1+6x_2-3x_3\\end{bmatrix}&=\\begin{bmatrix}3 \\\\ 7 \\\\ -5\\end{bmatrix}\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nEquating corresponding components, we obtain\n\n$$\n\\left\\{\\begin{aligned}x_1-3x_2+2x_3 &=3 \\\\ 3x_1-8x_2+5x_3 &=7 \\\\ -2x_1+6x_2-3x_3 &=-5\\end{aligned}\\right.\n$$\n\nThe augmented matrix is\n\n$$\nM=\\left[\\begin{array}{ccc|c}1 & -3 & 2 & 3 \\\\ 3 & -8 & 5 & 7 \\\\ -2 & 6 & -3 & -5\\end{array}\\right]\n$$\n\nUse Gaussian elimination:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}M&=\\left[\\begin{array}{ccc|c}1 & -3 & 2 & 3 \\\\ 3 & -8 & 5 & 7 \\\\ -2 & 6 & -3 & -5\\end{array}\\right] \\\\ &\\sim \\left[\\begin{array}{ccc|c}1 & -3 & 2 & 3 \\\\ 0 & 1 & -1 & -2 \\\\ -2 & 6 & -3 & -5\\end{array}\\right] && R_2:=R_2-3R_1 \\\\ &\\sim \\left[\\begin{array}{ccc|c}1 & -3 & 2 & 3 \\\\ 0 & 1 & -1 & -2 \\\\ 0 & 0 & 1 & 1\\end{array}\\right] && R_3:=R_3+2R_1\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nThe resulting system is\n\n$$\n\\left\\{\\begin{aligned}x_1-3x_2+2x_3 &=3 \\\\ x_2-x_3 &=-2 \\\\ x_3 &=1\\end{aligned}\\right.\n$$\n\nBack-substitute to find all three coefficients:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}x_3&=1 \\\\ x_2-1&=-2 &&\\Rightarrow\\quad x_2=-1 \\\\ x_1-3(-1)+2(1)&=3 &&\\Rightarrow\\quad x_1=-2\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}-2\\mathbf{a}_1-\\mathbf{a}_2+\\mathbf{a}_3&=\\mathbf{b}, \\\\ x_1+x_2+x_3&=-2-1+1=-2.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\n"} {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186713102 :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "048ba1aa-3cd1-568e-8a7c-e3e9409afe68" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "-5" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186713083} {:answer/id #uuid "07d66d55-55ad-55fa-93a2-7b785311d59a" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "5" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186713084} {:answer/id #uuid "5b9f9430-f0d0-582a-85ee-a121d459ba7b" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "0" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186713090} {:answer/id #uuid "5d6cd4f0-d853-536e-bd7f-bda6ebc7ffd0" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "No solution" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186713091} {:answer/id #uuid "b5181919-4315-5939-b1af-64c7ac7e3f28" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "3" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186713097}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "5d6cd4f0-d853-536e-bd7f-bda6ebc7ffd0" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "No solution" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186713091} :answer-field/id #uuid "d35a3f4d-069c-5ce3-b674-872cb78591f5" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type {:db/ident :answer-field.type/radio} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186713099}] :question/difficulty {:db/ident :question.difficulty/hard} :question/id #uuid "e4be4d61-f1d4-50f1-9dea-4bb25fe73dc5" :question/problem "Consider the vectors\n\n$$\n\\mathbf{a}_1=\\begin{bmatrix}1 \\\\ -1 \\\\ 0\\end{bmatrix},\\quad \\mathbf{a}_2=\\begin{bmatrix}-2 \\\\ 3 \\\\ -1\\end{bmatrix},\\quad \\mathbf{a}_3=\\begin{bmatrix}2 \\\\ 1 \\\\ -3\\end{bmatrix},\\quad \\mathbf{b}=\\begin{bmatrix}2 \\\\ -1 \\\\ 2\\end{bmatrix}\n$$\n\nIf $x_1\\mathbf{a}_1+x_2\\mathbf{a}_2+x_3\\mathbf{a}_3=\\mathbf{b}$, then what is $x_1+x_2+x_3$?" :question/worked-solution "Expanding the scalar multiples and adding corresponding components gives\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}x_1\\begin{bmatrix}1 \\\\ -1 \\\\ 0\\end{bmatrix}+x_2\\begin{bmatrix}-2 \\\\ 3 \\\\ -1\\end{bmatrix}+x_3\\begin{bmatrix}2 \\\\ 1 \\\\ -3\\end{bmatrix}&=\\begin{bmatrix}2 \\\\ -1 \\\\ 2\\end{bmatrix} \\\\ \\begin{bmatrix}x_1 \\\\ -x_1 \\\\ 0\\end{bmatrix}+\\begin{bmatrix}-2x_2 \\\\ 3x_2 \\\\ -x_2\\end{bmatrix}+\\begin{bmatrix}2x_3 \\\\ x_3 \\\\ -3x_3\\end{bmatrix}&=\\begin{bmatrix}2 \\\\ -1 \\\\ 2\\end{bmatrix} \\\\ \\begin{bmatrix}x_1-2x_2+2x_3 \\\\ -x_1+3x_2+x_3 \\\\ -x_2-3x_3\\end{bmatrix}&=\\begin{bmatrix}2 \\\\ -1 \\\\ 2\\end{bmatrix}\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nEquating corresponding components, we obtain\n\n$$\n\\left\\{\\begin{aligned}x_1-2x_2+2x_3 &=2 \\\\ -x_1+3x_2+x_3 &=-1 \\\\ -x_2-3x_3 &=2\\end{aligned}\\right.\n$$\n\nThe augmented matrix is\n\n$$\nM=\\left[\\begin{array}{ccc|c}1 & -2 & 2 & 2 \\\\ -1 & 3 & 1 & -1 \\\\ 0 & -1 & -3 & 2\\end{array}\\right]\n$$\n\nUse Gaussian elimination:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}M&=\\left[\\begin{array}{ccc|c}1 & -2 & 2 & 2 \\\\ -1 & 3 & 1 & -1 \\\\ 0 & -1 & -3 & 2\\end{array}\\right] \\\\ &\\sim \\left[\\begin{array}{ccc|c}1 & -2 & 2 & 2 \\\\ 0 & 1 & 3 & 1 \\\\ 0 & -1 & -3 & 2\\end{array}\\right] && R_2:=R_2+R_1 \\\\ &\\sim \\left[\\begin{array}{ccc|c}1 & -2 & 2 & 2 \\\\ 0 & 1 & 3 & 1 \\\\ 0 & 0 & 0 & 3\\end{array}\\right] && R_3:=R_3+R_2\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nThe resulting system is\n\n$$\n\\left\\{\\begin{aligned}x_1-2x_2+2x_3 &=2 \\\\ x_2+3x_3 &=1 \\\\ 0 &=3\\end{aligned}\\right.\n$$\n\nThe last equation, $0=3$, is false. No triple of coefficients satisfies all three component equations, so the vector equation has **no solution**. There is no value of $x_1+x_2+x_3$ to report."} {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186713354 :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "3127f85c-d478-5e14-8fbd-e9cbd08f079a" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "2" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186713342} {:answer/id #uuid "37f07b7d-f4e6-5b70-bcf8-dda1ea28a396" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "0" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186713343} {:answer/id #uuid "9f3c057e-cedf-58c8-a4b3-b67e49860874" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "-2" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186713360} {:answer/id #uuid "d2190eac-df31-5849-9974-62941803688a" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "-4" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186713365} {:answer/id #uuid "df4fa0dd-3a5a-54ad-9e4b-fd09c839669f" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "No solution" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186713366}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "9f3c057e-cedf-58c8-a4b3-b67e49860874" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "-2" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186713360} :answer-field/id #uuid "3f5576ed-6940-52b5-8bc0-6f2787c49489" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type {:db/ident :answer-field.type/radio} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186713346}] :question/difficulty {:db/ident :question.difficulty/easy} :question/id #uuid "6e428022-0377-5e4f-9de9-84176c2013bc" :question/problem "Consider the vectors\n\n$$\na_1=\\begin{bmatrix}-1 \\\\ 0 \\\\ 0\\end{bmatrix},\\quad a_2=\\begin{bmatrix}-1 \\\\ 1 \\\\ 0\\end{bmatrix},\\quad a_3=\\begin{bmatrix}-1 \\\\ 1 \\\\ 1\\end{bmatrix},\\quad b=\\begin{bmatrix}2 \\\\ 0 \\\\ 0\\end{bmatrix}\n$$\n\nIf $x_1a_1+x_2a_2+x_3a_3=b,$ then what is $x_{1} + x_{2} - x_{3}?$" :question/worked-solution "If $x_1a_1+x_2a_2+x_3a_3=b$, then we have\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}x_1\\begin{bmatrix}-1 \\\\ 0 \\\\ 0\\end{bmatrix}+x_2\\begin{bmatrix}-1 \\\\ 1 \\\\ 0\\end{bmatrix}+x_3\\begin{bmatrix}-1 \\\\ 1 \\\\ 1\\end{bmatrix}&=\\begin{bmatrix}2 \\\\ 0 \\\\ 0\\end{bmatrix} \\\\ \\begin{bmatrix}- x_{1} \\\\ 0 \\\\ 0\\end{bmatrix}+\\begin{bmatrix}- x_{2} \\\\ x_{2} \\\\ 0\\end{bmatrix}+\\begin{bmatrix}- x_{3} \\\\ x_{3} \\\\ x_{3}\\end{bmatrix}&=\\begin{bmatrix}2 \\\\ 0 \\\\ 0\\end{bmatrix} \\\\ \\begin{bmatrix}- x_{1} - x_{2} - x_{3} \\\\ x_{2} + x_{3} \\\\ x_{3}\\end{bmatrix}&=\\begin{bmatrix}2 \\\\ 0 \\\\ 0\\end{bmatrix}\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nEquating the corresponding components, we get the following system:\n\n$$\n\\left\\{\\begin{aligned}- x_{1} - x_{2} - x_{3} &=2 \\\\ x_{2} + x_{3} &=0 \\\\ x_{3} &=0\\end{aligned}\\right.\n$$\n\nWe will solve this system using Gaussian elimination. First, we write the augmented matrix for this system:\n\n$$\nM=\\left[\\begin{array}{ccc|c}-1 & -1 & -1 & 2 \\\\ 0 & 1 & 1 & 0 \\\\ 0 & 0 & 1 & 0\\end{array}\\right]\n$$\n\nRow-reducing the augmented matrix, we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}M&=\\left[\\begin{array}{ccc|c}-1 & -1 & -1 & 2 \\\\ 0 & 1 & 1 & 0 \\\\ 0 & 0 & 1 & 0\\end{array}\\right] \\\\ &\\sim \\left[\\begin{array}{ccc|c}1 & 1 & 1 & -2 \\\\ 0 & 1 & 1 & 0 \\\\ 0 & 0 & 1 & 0\\end{array}\\right] && R_{1}:=(-1)R_{1}\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nThe system is now\n\n$$\n\\left\\{\\begin{aligned}x_{1} + x_{2} + x_{3} &=-2 \\\\ x_{2} + x_{3} &=0 \\\\ x_{3} &=0\\end{aligned}\\right.\n$$\n\nFrom the third equation, we get $x_3=0.$ Substituting this value into the second equation, we get\n\n$$\n1x_2+(1)(0)=0\\quad\\Rightarrow\\quad x_2=0\n$$\n\nFinally, substituting these values into the first equation, we obtain\n\n$$\n1x_1+(1)(0)+(1)(0)=-2\\quad\\Rightarrow\\quad x_1=-2\n$$\n\nSo, the solution of the system is $x_1=-2$, $x_2=0$, $x_3=0$, which means\n\n$$\n-2a_1+(0)a_2+(0)a_3=b.\n$$\n\nConsequently,\n\n$$\nx_{1} + x_{2} - x_{3}=(-2)+(0)+(0)=-2.\n$$\n\n"} {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186713355 :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "29a20b6c-5eda-51e8-8d4c-c22b9bdf1661" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "-4" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186713340} {:answer/id #uuid "2d0de62f-fe9d-50ff-86e4-2ade17186af9" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "-7" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186713341} {:answer/id #uuid "47e275d5-c84d-5d49-b443-0ecd2b460b4a" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "-1" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186713347} {:answer/id #uuid "617cd8c5-7c73-58f9-85d9-6bbe2011585f" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "5" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186713353} {:answer/id #uuid "918b2080-5eec-53d8-88d2-9503aebb9039" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "No solution" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186713359}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "47e275d5-c84d-5d49-b443-0ecd2b460b4a" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "-1" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186713347} :answer-field/id #uuid "ec199e82-f184-59c5-a101-a0b2150e2e71" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type {:db/ident :answer-field.type/radio} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186713367}] :question/difficulty {:db/ident :question.difficulty/easy} :question/id #uuid "72fc6cad-113f-5b05-87eb-11767ab04775" :question/problem "Consider the vectors\n\n$$\na_1=\\begin{bmatrix}-1 \\\\ 0 \\\\ 0\\end{bmatrix},\\quad a_2=\\begin{bmatrix}-1 \\\\ 1 \\\\ 0\\end{bmatrix},\\quad a_3=\\begin{bmatrix}-1 \\\\ 0 \\\\ -1\\end{bmatrix},\\quad b=\\begin{bmatrix}-5 \\\\ 3 \\\\ -3\\end{bmatrix}\n$$\n\nIf $x_1a_1+x_2a_2+x_3a_3=b,$ then what is $x_{1} - x_{2} + x_{3}?$" :question/worked-solution "If $x_1a_1+x_2a_2+x_3a_3=b$, then we have\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}x_1\\begin{bmatrix}-1 \\\\ 0 \\\\ 0\\end{bmatrix}+x_2\\begin{bmatrix}-1 \\\\ 1 \\\\ 0\\end{bmatrix}+x_3\\begin{bmatrix}-1 \\\\ 0 \\\\ -1\\end{bmatrix}&=\\begin{bmatrix}-5 \\\\ 3 \\\\ -3\\end{bmatrix} \\\\ \\begin{bmatrix}- x_{1} \\\\ 0 \\\\ 0\\end{bmatrix}+\\begin{bmatrix}- x_{2} \\\\ x_{2} \\\\ 0\\end{bmatrix}+\\begin{bmatrix}- x_{3} \\\\ 0 \\\\ - x_{3}\\end{bmatrix}&=\\begin{bmatrix}-5 \\\\ 3 \\\\ -3\\end{bmatrix} \\\\ \\begin{bmatrix}- x_{1} - x_{2} - x_{3} \\\\ x_{2} \\\\ - x_{3}\\end{bmatrix}&=\\begin{bmatrix}-5 \\\\ 3 \\\\ -3\\end{bmatrix}\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nEquating the corresponding components, we get the following system:\n\n$$\n\\left\\{\\begin{aligned}- x_{1} - x_{2} - x_{3} &=-5 \\\\ x_{2} &=3 \\\\ - x_{3} &=-3\\end{aligned}\\right.\n$$\n\nWe will solve this system using Gaussian elimination. First, we write the augmented matrix for this system:\n\n$$\nM=\\left[\\begin{array}{ccc|c}-1 & -1 & -1 & -5 \\\\ 0 & 1 & 0 & 3 \\\\ 0 & 0 & -1 & -3\\end{array}\\right]\n$$\n\nRow-reducing the augmented matrix, we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}M&=\\left[\\begin{array}{ccc|c}-1 & -1 & -1 & -5 \\\\ 0 & 1 & 0 & 3 \\\\ 0 & 0 & -1 & -3\\end{array}\\right] \\\\ &\\sim \\left[\\begin{array}{ccc|c}1 & 1 & 1 & 5 \\\\ 0 & 1 & 0 & 3 \\\\ 0 & 0 & -1 & -3\\end{array}\\right] && R_{1}:=(-1)R_{1} \\\\ &\\sim \\left[\\begin{array}{ccc|c}1 & 1 & 1 & 5 \\\\ 0 & 1 & 0 & 3 \\\\ 0 & 0 & 1 & 3\\end{array}\\right] && R_{3}:=(-1)R_{3}\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nThe system is now\n\n$$\n\\left\\{\\begin{aligned}x_{1} + x_{2} + x_{3} &=5 \\\\ x_{2} &=3 \\\\ x_{3} &=3\\end{aligned}\\right.\n$$\n\nFrom the third equation, we get $x_3=3.$ Substituting this value into the second equation, we get\n\n$$\n1x_2+(0)(3)=3\\quad\\Rightarrow\\quad x_2=3\n$$\n\nFinally, substituting these values into the first equation, we obtain\n\n$$\n1x_1+(1)(3)+(1)(3)=5\\quad\\Rightarrow\\quad x_1=-1\n$$\n\nSo, the solution of the system is $x_1=-1$, $x_2=3$, $x_3=3$, which means\n\n$$\n-1a_1+(3)a_2+(3)a_3=b.\n$$\n\nConsequently,\n\n$$\nx_{1} - x_{2} + x_{3}=(-1)+(-3)+(3)=-1.\n$$\n\n"} {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186713357 :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "030f73de-8493-509c-b7fa-c7b567614ed6" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "No solution" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186713338} {:answer/id #uuid "39ca9862-bc45-52da-8c3b-7e81a827ef53" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "-4" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186713344} {:answer/id #uuid "f0d1c435-8869-5658-8484-f9c3588630af" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "5" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186713368} {:answer/id #uuid "f7c0c288-ec96-5cf9-bf65-2fe916e18fab" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "3" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186713370} {:answer/id #uuid "fba53540-aeca-5060-8c60-33f22e478f74" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "2" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186713371}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "39ca9862-bc45-52da-8c3b-7e81a827ef53" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "-4" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186713344} :answer-field/id #uuid "8ff83aa9-f5ff-586e-8a26-8f6e8e3ac17e" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type {:db/ident :answer-field.type/radio} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186713358}] :question/difficulty {:db/ident :question.difficulty/easy} :question/id #uuid "896a9ee8-8ddf-5421-a650-4d66a0b0717f" :question/problem "Consider the vectors\n\n$$\na_1=\\begin{bmatrix}-1 \\\\ 1 \\\\ -1\\end{bmatrix},\\quad a_2=\\begin{bmatrix}1 \\\\ 0 \\\\ 0\\end{bmatrix},\\quad a_3=\\begin{bmatrix}1 \\\\ -1 \\\\ 0\\end{bmatrix},\\quad b=\\begin{bmatrix}-4 \\\\ 4 \\\\ -3\\end{bmatrix}\n$$\n\nIf $x_1a_1+x_2a_2+x_3a_3=b,$ then what is $- x_{1} + x_{2} + x_{3}?$" :question/worked-solution "If $x_1a_1+x_2a_2+x_3a_3=b$, then we have\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}x_1\\begin{bmatrix}-1 \\\\ 1 \\\\ -1\\end{bmatrix}+x_2\\begin{bmatrix}1 \\\\ 0 \\\\ 0\\end{bmatrix}+x_3\\begin{bmatrix}1 \\\\ -1 \\\\ 0\\end{bmatrix}&=\\begin{bmatrix}-4 \\\\ 4 \\\\ -3\\end{bmatrix} \\\\ \\begin{bmatrix}- x_{1} \\\\ x_{1} \\\\ - x_{1}\\end{bmatrix}+\\begin{bmatrix}x_{2} \\\\ 0 \\\\ 0\\end{bmatrix}+\\begin{bmatrix}x_{3} \\\\ - x_{3} \\\\ 0\\end{bmatrix}&=\\begin{bmatrix}-4 \\\\ 4 \\\\ -3\\end{bmatrix} \\\\ \\begin{bmatrix}- x_{1} + x_{2} + x_{3} \\\\ x_{1} - x_{3} \\\\ - x_{1}\\end{bmatrix}&=\\begin{bmatrix}-4 \\\\ 4 \\\\ -3\\end{bmatrix}\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nEquating the corresponding components, we get the following system:\n\n$$\n\\left\\{\\begin{aligned}- x_{1} + x_{2} + x_{3} &=-4 \\\\ x_{1} - x_{3} &=4 \\\\ - x_{1} &=-3\\end{aligned}\\right.\n$$\n\nWe will solve this system using Gaussian elimination. First, we write the augmented matrix for this system:\n\n$$\nM=\\left[\\begin{array}{ccc|c}-1 & 1 & 1 & -4 \\\\ 1 & 0 & -1 & 4 \\\\ -1 & 0 & 0 & -3\\end{array}\\right]\n$$\n\nRow-reducing the augmented matrix, we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}M&=\\left[\\begin{array}{ccc|c}-1 & 1 & 1 & -4 \\\\ 1 & 0 & -1 & 4 \\\\ -1 & 0 & 0 & -3\\end{array}\\right] \\\\ &\\sim \\left[\\begin{array}{ccc|c}1 & -1 & -1 & 4 \\\\ 1 & 0 & -1 & 4 \\\\ -1 & 0 & 0 & -3\\end{array}\\right] && R_{1}:=(-1)R_{1} \\\\ &\\sim \\left[\\begin{array}{ccc|c}1 & -1 & -1 & 4 \\\\ 0 & 1 & 0 & 0 \\\\ -1 & 0 & 0 & -3\\end{array}\\right] && R_{2}:=R_{2}+(-1)R_{1} \\\\ &\\sim \\left[\\begin{array}{ccc|c}1 & -1 & -1 & 4 \\\\ 0 & 1 & 0 & 0 \\\\ 0 & -1 & -1 & 1\\end{array}\\right] && R_{3}:=R_{3}+(1)R_{1} \\\\ &\\sim \\left[\\begin{array}{ccc|c}1 & -1 & -1 & 4 \\\\ 0 & 1 & 0 & 0 \\\\ 0 & 0 & -1 & 1\\end{array}\\right] && R_{3}:=R_{3}+(1)R_{2} \\\\ &\\sim \\left[\\begin{array}{ccc|c}1 & -1 & -1 & 4 \\\\ 0 & 1 & 0 & 0 \\\\ 0 & 0 & 1 & -1\\end{array}\\right] && R_{3}:=(-1)R_{3}\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nThe system is now\n\n$$\n\\left\\{\\begin{aligned}x_{1} - x_{2} - x_{3} &=4 \\\\ x_{2} &=0 \\\\ x_{3} &=-1\\end{aligned}\\right.\n$$\n\nFrom the third equation, we get $x_3=-1.$ Substituting this value into the second equation, we get\n\n$$\n1x_2+(0)(-1)=0\\quad\\Rightarrow\\quad x_2=0\n$$\n\nFinally, substituting these values into the first equation, we obtain\n\n$$\n1x_1+(-1)(0)+(-1)(-1)=4\\quad\\Rightarrow\\quad x_1=3\n$$\n\nSo, the solution of the system is $x_1=3$, $x_2=0$, $x_3=-1$, which means\n\n$$\n3a_1+(0)a_2+(-1)a_3=b.\n$$\n\nConsequently,\n\n$$\n- x_{1} + x_{2} + x_{3}=(-3)+(0)+(-1)=-4.\n$$\n\n"} {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186713362 :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "4be30bef-364e-55a4-a672-56419ee86b6c" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "-2" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186713348} {:answer/id #uuid "537288f8-af67-579e-afcb-f8d0826ef139" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "5" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186713351} {:answer/id #uuid "8859e3c8-cddd-55c8-9dfb-7ef4bad9122c" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "-5" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186713356} {:answer/id #uuid "d1376bda-2e03-5a88-9764-916585d8572f" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "No solution" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186713364} {:answer/id #uuid "fe216153-745c-5783-8bcc-4e20f87018d8" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "-1" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186713372}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "537288f8-af67-579e-afcb-f8d0826ef139" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "5" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186713351} :answer-field/id #uuid "54e1f414-1725-5d59-b505-6845ca5d6c7b" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type {:db/ident :answer-field.type/radio} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186713352}] :question/difficulty {:db/ident :question.difficulty/easy} :question/id #uuid "a6853292-5214-56ba-853e-227a7f78ca5e" :question/problem "Consider the vectors\n\n$$\na_1=\\begin{bmatrix}0 \\\\ -1 \\\\ 0\\end{bmatrix},\\quad a_2=\\begin{bmatrix}-1 \\\\ 0 \\\\ 0\\end{bmatrix},\\quad a_3=\\begin{bmatrix}1 \\\\ 0 \\\\ -1\\end{bmatrix},\\quad b=\\begin{bmatrix}1 \\\\ 2 \\\\ -2\\end{bmatrix}\n$$\n\nIf $x_1a_1+x_2a_2+x_3a_3=b,$ then what is $- x_{1} + x_{2} + x_{3}?$" :question/worked-solution "If $x_1a_1+x_2a_2+x_3a_3=b$, then we have\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}x_1\\begin{bmatrix}0 \\\\ -1 \\\\ 0\\end{bmatrix}+x_2\\begin{bmatrix}-1 \\\\ 0 \\\\ 0\\end{bmatrix}+x_3\\begin{bmatrix}1 \\\\ 0 \\\\ -1\\end{bmatrix}&=\\begin{bmatrix}1 \\\\ 2 \\\\ -2\\end{bmatrix} \\\\ \\begin{bmatrix}0 \\\\ - x_{1} \\\\ 0\\end{bmatrix}+\\begin{bmatrix}- x_{2} \\\\ 0 \\\\ 0\\end{bmatrix}+\\begin{bmatrix}x_{3} \\\\ 0 \\\\ - x_{3}\\end{bmatrix}&=\\begin{bmatrix}1 \\\\ 2 \\\\ -2\\end{bmatrix} \\\\ \\begin{bmatrix}- x_{2} + x_{3} \\\\ - x_{1} \\\\ - x_{3}\\end{bmatrix}&=\\begin{bmatrix}1 \\\\ 2 \\\\ -2\\end{bmatrix}\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nEquating the corresponding components, we get the following system:\n\n$$\n\\left\\{\\begin{aligned}- x_{2} + x_{3} &=1 \\\\ - x_{1} &=2 \\\\ - x_{3} &=-2\\end{aligned}\\right.\n$$\n\nWe will solve this system using Gaussian elimination. First, we write the augmented matrix for this system:\n\n$$\nM=\\left[\\begin{array}{ccc|c}0 & -1 & 1 & 1 \\\\ -1 & 0 & 0 & 2 \\\\ 0 & 0 & -1 & -2\\end{array}\\right]\n$$\n\nRow-reducing the augmented matrix, we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}M&=\\left[\\begin{array}{ccc|c}0 & -1 & 1 & 1 \\\\ -1 & 0 & 0 & 2 \\\\ 0 & 0 & -1 & -2\\end{array}\\right] \\\\ &\\sim \\left[\\begin{array}{ccc|c}-1 & 0 & 0 & 2 \\\\ 0 & -1 & 1 & 1 \\\\ 0 & 0 & -1 & -2\\end{array}\\right] && R_{1}\\leftrightarrow R_{2} \\\\ &\\sim \\left[\\begin{array}{ccc|c}1 & 0 & 0 & -2 \\\\ 0 & -1 & 1 & 1 \\\\ 0 & 0 & -1 & -2\\end{array}\\right] && R_{1}:=(-1)R_{1} \\\\ &\\sim \\left[\\begin{array}{ccc|c}1 & 0 & 0 & -2 \\\\ 0 & 1 & -1 & -1 \\\\ 0 & 0 & -1 & -2\\end{array}\\right] && R_{2}:=(-1)R_{2} \\\\ &\\sim \\left[\\begin{array}{ccc|c}1 & 0 & 0 & -2 \\\\ 0 & 1 & -1 & -1 \\\\ 0 & 0 & 1 & 2\\end{array}\\right] && R_{3}:=(-1)R_{3}\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nThe system is now\n\n$$\n\\left\\{\\begin{aligned}x_{1} &=-2 \\\\ x_{2} - x_{3} &=-1 \\\\ x_{3} &=2\\end{aligned}\\right.\n$$\n\nFrom the third equation, we get $x_3=2.$ Substituting this value into the second equation, we get\n\n$$\n1x_2+(-1)(2)=-1\\quad\\Rightarrow\\quad x_2=1\n$$\n\nFinally, substituting these values into the first equation, we obtain\n\n$$\n1x_1+(0)(1)+(0)(2)=-2\\quad\\Rightarrow\\quad x_1=-2\n$$\n\nSo, the solution of the system is $x_1=-2$, $x_2=1$, $x_3=2$, which means\n\n$$\n-2a_1+(1)a_2+(2)a_3=b.\n$$\n\nConsequently,\n\n$$\n- x_{1} + x_{2} + x_{3}=(2)+(1)+(2)=5.\n$$\n\n"} {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186713369 :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "2746ebf3-5208-51f5-9c33-8cec4486cb39" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "0" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186713339} {:answer/id #uuid "3c8ba999-fc5f-592f-8740-fc216452823f" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "-4" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186713345} {:answer/id #uuid "4f068de0-b5ea-5167-97c5-98603254c7ae" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "2" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186713349} {:answer/id #uuid "a0c946ed-7f59-5fd7-8acb-713d0326ebfb" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "-2" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186713361} {:answer/id #uuid "cabd0bf3-54eb-5d5a-9171-cb02d3b76dcb" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "No solution" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186713363}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "a0c946ed-7f59-5fd7-8acb-713d0326ebfb" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "-2" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186713361} :answer-field/id #uuid "4fa9bc8d-8284-5f4c-864d-8cb0a190403e" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type {:db/ident :answer-field.type/radio} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186713350}] :question/difficulty {:db/ident :question.difficulty/easy} :question/id #uuid "f7814008-3b02-55fd-8649-287703d8d72a" :question/problem "Consider the vectors\n\n$$\na_1=\\begin{bmatrix}-1 \\\\ 0 \\\\ 1\\end{bmatrix},\\quad a_2=\\begin{bmatrix}-1 \\\\ 0 \\\\ 0\\end{bmatrix},\\quad a_3=\\begin{bmatrix}0 \\\\ -1 \\\\ 0\\end{bmatrix},\\quad b=\\begin{bmatrix}1 \\\\ 3 \\\\ 0\\end{bmatrix}\n$$\n\nIf $x_1a_1+x_2a_2+x_3a_3=b,$ then what is $x_{1} - x_{2} + x_{3}?$" :question/worked-solution "If $x_1a_1+x_2a_2+x_3a_3=b$, then we have\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}x_1\\begin{bmatrix}-1 \\\\ 0 \\\\ 1\\end{bmatrix}+x_2\\begin{bmatrix}-1 \\\\ 0 \\\\ 0\\end{bmatrix}+x_3\\begin{bmatrix}0 \\\\ -1 \\\\ 0\\end{bmatrix}&=\\begin{bmatrix}1 \\\\ 3 \\\\ 0\\end{bmatrix} \\\\ \\begin{bmatrix}- x_{1} \\\\ 0 \\\\ x_{1}\\end{bmatrix}+\\begin{bmatrix}- x_{2} \\\\ 0 \\\\ 0\\end{bmatrix}+\\begin{bmatrix}0 \\\\ - x_{3} \\\\ 0\\end{bmatrix}&=\\begin{bmatrix}1 \\\\ 3 \\\\ 0\\end{bmatrix} \\\\ \\begin{bmatrix}- x_{1} - x_{2} \\\\ - x_{3} \\\\ x_{1}\\end{bmatrix}&=\\begin{bmatrix}1 \\\\ 3 \\\\ 0\\end{bmatrix}\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nEquating the corresponding components, we get the following system:\n\n$$\n\\left\\{\\begin{aligned}- x_{1} - x_{2} &=1 \\\\ - x_{3} &=3 \\\\ x_{1} &=0\\end{aligned}\\right.\n$$\n\nWe will solve this system using Gaussian elimination. First, we write the augmented matrix for this system:\n\n$$\nM=\\left[\\begin{array}{ccc|c}-1 & -1 & 0 & 1 \\\\ 0 & 0 & -1 & 3 \\\\ 1 & 0 & 0 & 0\\end{array}\\right]\n$$\n\nRow-reducing the augmented matrix, we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}M&=\\left[\\begin{array}{ccc|c}-1 & -1 & 0 & 1 \\\\ 0 & 0 & -1 & 3 \\\\ 1 & 0 & 0 & 0\\end{array}\\right] \\\\ &\\sim \\left[\\begin{array}{ccc|c}1 & 1 & 0 & -1 \\\\ 0 & 0 & -1 & 3 \\\\ 1 & 0 & 0 & 0\\end{array}\\right] && R_{1}:=(-1)R_{1} \\\\ &\\sim \\left[\\begin{array}{ccc|c}1 & 1 & 0 & -1 \\\\ 0 & 0 & -1 & 3 \\\\ 0 & -1 & 0 & 1\\end{array}\\right] && R_{3}:=R_{3}+(-1)R_{1} \\\\ &\\sim \\left[\\begin{array}{ccc|c}1 & 1 & 0 & -1 \\\\ 0 & -1 & 0 & 1 \\\\ 0 & 0 & -1 & 3\\end{array}\\right] && R_{2}\\leftrightarrow R_{3} \\\\ &\\sim \\left[\\begin{array}{ccc|c}1 & 1 & 0 & -1 \\\\ 0 & 1 & 0 & -1 \\\\ 0 & 0 & -1 & 3\\end{array}\\right] && R_{2}:=(-1)R_{2} \\\\ &\\sim \\left[\\begin{array}{ccc|c}1 & 1 & 0 & -1 \\\\ 0 & 1 & 0 & -1 \\\\ 0 & 0 & 1 & -3\\end{array}\\right] && R_{3}:=(-1)R_{3}\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nThe system is now\n\n$$\n\\left\\{\\begin{aligned}x_{1} + x_{2} &=-1 \\\\ x_{2} &=-1 \\\\ x_{3} &=-3\\end{aligned}\\right.\n$$\n\nFrom the third equation, we get $x_3=-3.$ Substituting this value into the second equation, we get\n\n$$\n1x_2+(0)(-3)=-1\\quad\\Rightarrow\\quad x_2=-1\n$$\n\nFinally, substituting these values into the first equation, we obtain\n\n$$\n1x_1+(1)(-1)+(0)(-3)=-1\\quad\\Rightarrow\\quad x_1=0\n$$\n\nSo, the solution of the system is $x_1=0$, $x_2=-1$, $x_3=-3$, which means\n\n$$\n0a_1+(-1)a_2+(-3)a_3=b.\n$$\n\nConsequently,\n\n$$\nx_{1} - x_{2} + x_{3}=(0)+(1)+(-3)=-2.\n$$\n\n"}] :knowledge-point/title "Solving for Three Coefficients in a Linear Combination"}]}
